20 wind turbines are being proposed across two clusters at Mount Hope and Black Stump that  will be capable of generating 2,000,000 megawatt hours of clean renewable energy each year.'),(25132,1125,'_sec_3_text','field_5de6e4044e5e8'),(25133,1125,'page_col_image_2','436'),(25134,1125,'_page_col_image_2','field_5de6546e7c63a'),(25135,1125,'sec_2_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/community\">More about the community</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/about/\">Positives for the area</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"#contact\">Contact us</a>\r\n'),(25136,1125,'_sec_2_button','field_5de6e58c86706'),(25137,1125,'sec_3_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/the-project/\">Detailed project description</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"#location\">Location map</a>'),(25138,1125,'_sec_3_button','field_5de6e5a243c03'),(25139,1125,'page_col_image_4','455'),(25140,1125,'_page_col_image_4','field_5de70801090ce'),(25141,1125,'sec_4_title','Location'),(25142,1125,'_sec_4_title','field_5de7082a12a81'),(25143,1125,'sec_4_text','The project will be located in Central NSW about 5km south-west of the small rural township of Coolah. About 120 wind turbines are being proposed across two clusters at Mount Hope and Black Stump.'),(25144,1125,'_sec_4_text','field_5de7084812a82'),(25145,1125,'sec_4_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/about/\">Detailed location information</a>'),(25146,1125,'_sec_4_button','field_5de7085e12a83'),(25147,1125,'news_title','Project updates'),(25148,1125,'_news_title','field_5de78da3aabb9'),(25149,1125,'sec_2_text_copy',''),(25150,1125,'_sec_2_text_copy','field_5de78dc89e613'),(25151,1125,'timeline-title','Timeline'),(25152,1125,'_timeline-title','field_5de78df29e615'),(25153,1125,'timeline_title','Timeline'),(25154,1125,'_timeline_title','field_5de78df29e615'),(25155,1125,'contact_title','Contact us'),(25156,1125,'_contact_title','field_5de7981e06057'),(25157,1125,'contact_intro','Contact text.