wo clusters at Mount Hope and Black Stump that  will be capable of generating 2,000,000 megawatt hours of clean renewable energy each year.'),(36371,1515,'_sec_3_text','field_5de6e4044e5e8'),(36372,1515,'page_col_image_2','436'),(36373,1515,'_page_col_image_2','field_5de6546e7c63a'),(36374,1515,'sec_2_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/community\">More about the community</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/about/\">Positives for the area</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"#contact\">Contact us</a>\r\n'),(36375,1515,'_sec_2_button','field_5de6e58c86706'),(36376,1515,'sec_3_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/the-project/\">Detailed project description</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"#location\">Location map</a>'),(36377,1515,'_sec_3_button','field_5de6e5a243c03'),(36378,1515,'page_col_image_4','455'),(36379,1515,'_page_col_image_4','field_5de70801090ce'),(36380,1515,'sec_4_title','Location'),(36381,1515,'_sec_4_title','field_5de7082a12a81'),(36382,1515,'sec_4_text','The project will be located in Central NSW about 5km south-west of the small rural township of Coolah. About 120 wind turbines are being proposed across two clusters at Mount Hope and Black Stump.'),(36383,1515,'_sec_4_text','field_5de7084812a82'),(36384,1515,'sec_4_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/about/\">Detailed location information</a>'),(36385,1515,'_sec_4_button','field_5de7085e12a83'),(36386,1515,'news_title','Project updates'),(36387,1515,'_news_title','field_5de78da3aabb9'),(36388,1515,'sec_2_text_copy',''),(36389,1515,'_sec_2_text_copy','field_5de78dc89e613'),(36390,1515,'timeline-title','Timeline'),(36391,1515,'_timeline-title','field_5de78df29e615'),(36392,1515,'timeline_title','Timeline'),(36393,1515,'_timeline_title','field_5de78df29e615'),(36394,1515,'contact_title','Contact us'),(36395,1515,'_contact_title','field_5de7981e06057'),(36396,1515,'contact_intro','Contact text...'),(36397,1515,'_contact_intro','field_5de