 the community</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/about/\">Positives for the area</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"#contact\">Contact us</a>\r\n'),(49769,1644,'_sec_2_button','field_5de6e58c86706'),(49770,1644,'sec_3_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/the-project/\">Detailed project description</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"#location\">Location map</a>'),(49771,1644,'_sec_3_button','field_5de6e5a243c03'),(49772,1644,'page_col_image_4','455'),(49773,1644,'_page_col_image_4','field_5de70801090ce'),(49774,1644,'sec_4_title','Location'),(49775,1644,'_sec_4_title','field_5de7082a12a81'),(49776,1644,'sec_4_text','The project will be located in Central NSW about 5km south-west of the small rural township of Coolah. About 120 wind turbines are being proposed across two clusters at Mount Hope and Black Stump.'),(49777,1644,'_sec_4_text','field_5de7084812a82'),(49778,1644,'sec_4_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/about/\">Detailed location information</a>'),(49779,1644,'_sec_4_button','field_5de7085e12a83'),(49780,1644,'news_title','Project updates'),(49781,1644,'_news_title','field_5de78da3aabb9'),(49782,1644,'sec_2_text_copy',''),(49783,1644,'_sec_2_text_copy','field_5de78dc89e613'),(49784,1644,'timeline-title','Timeline'),(49785,1644,'_timeline-title','field_5de78df29e615'),(49786,1644,'timeline_title','Timeline'),(49787,1644,'_timeline_title','field_5de78df29e615'),(49788,1644,'contact_title','Contact us'),(49789,1644,'_contact_title','field_5de7981e06057'),(49790,1644,'contact_intro','Contact text...'),(49791,1644,'_contact_intro','field_5de7983506058'),(49792,1644,'news_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home btn-news\" href=\"/updates/\">See all updates</a>'),(49793,1644,'_news_button','field_5de8329896e02'),(49794,1644,'timeline_intro','Introduction of timeline detail...'),(49795,1644,'_timeline_intro','field_5de98f5fb1781'),(49796,1644,'timeline_pic','477'),(49797,1644,'_timeline_pic','field_5de98f72b1782'),(49798,