onal housing agreement between commonwealth and state governments with targets and funding for the construction of affordable homes.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out tax breaks for property investors and using the increase in revenue to build more public housing.</li>\r\n 	<li>Establish laws which limit rental increases beyond what is fair.</li>\r\n 	<li>Rebalance tenancy laws to provide renters with more security and control, such as eliminating no grounds evictions.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out stamp duty and replace it with a broad-based land tax.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>While there are many opinions on what policy changes will fix the housing market, doing nothing is not an option.</h4>'),(55117,1722,'_solutions_content','field_640e8b307a958'),(55118,1722,'problem_icons_0_prob_icon','1699'),(55119,1722,'_problem_icons_0_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(55120,1722,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','70%'),(55121,1722,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(55122,1722,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(55123,1722,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(55124,1722,'problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text','House prices have doubled in a decade'),(55125,1722,'_problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(55126,1722,'problem_icons','4'),(55127,1722,'_problem_icons','field_640fa0191d518'),(55128,1722,'ceh_content_left',''),(55129,1722,'_ceh_content_left','field_640e97e8f1c8c'),(55130,1722,'ceh_content_right',''),(55131,1722,'_ceh_content_right','field_640e97fdf1c8d'),(55132,1722,'pc_content_left',''),(55133,1722,'_pc_content_left','field_640e983bf1c8f'),(55134,1722,'pc_content_right',''),(55135,1722,'_pc_content_right','field_640e984df1c90'),(55136,1722,'problem_icons_1_prob_icon','1699'),(55137,1722,'_problem_icons_1_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(55138,1722,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','69%'),(55139,1722,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(55140,1722,'problem_ic