/li>\r\n 	<li>Establish laws which limit rental increases beyond what is fair.</li>\r\n 	<li>Rebalance tenancy laws to provide renters with more security and control, such as eliminating no grounds evictions.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out stamp duty and replace it with a broad-based land tax.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>While there are many opinions on what policy changes will fix the housing market, doing nothing is not an option.</h4>'),(59900,1813,'_solutions_content','field_640e8b307a958'),(59901,1813,'problem_icons_0_prob_icon','1699'),(59902,1813,'_problem_icons_0_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(59903,1813,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','70% highly concerned'),(59904,1813,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(59905,1813,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(59906,1813,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(59907,1813,'problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text',''),(59908,1813,'_problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(59909,1813,'problem_icons','4'),(59910,1813,'_problem_icons','field_640fa0191d518'),(59911,1813,'ceh_content_left',''),(59912,1813,'_ceh_content_left','field_640e97e8f1c8c'),(59913,1813,'ceh_content_right',''),(59914,1813,'_ceh_content_right','field_640e97fdf1c8d'),(59915,1813,'pc_content_left',''),(59916,1813,'_pc_content_left','field_640e983bf1c8f'),(59917,1813,'pc_content_right',''),(59918,1813,'_pc_content_right','field_640e984df1c90'),(59919,1813,'problem_icons_1_prob_icon','1699'),(59920,1813,'_problem_icons_1_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(59921,1813,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','69% highly concerned'),(59922,1813,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(59923,1813,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(59924,1813,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(59925,1813,'problem_icons_1_prob_issue_text',''),(59926,1813,'_problem_icons_1_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(59927,1813,'