semper at, feugiat vel orci. '),(61215,1821,'_report_intro','field_62f30eedb57e2'),(61216,1821,'report_link_url','#'),(61217,1821,'_report_link_url','field_62f30ef4b57e3'),(61218,1821,'report_link_text','Download'),(61219,1821,'_report_link_text','field_62f30f01b57e4'),(61220,1821,'solutions_content','The housing system is complex, and no one solution will solve the complex problems we now face but there are some critical first steps to be taken now.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Set out an ambitious national housing agreement between commonwealth and state governments with targets and funding for the construction of affordable homes.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out tax breaks for property investors and using the increase in revenue to build more public housing.</li>\r\n 	<li>Establish laws which limit rental increases beyond what is fair.</li>\r\n 	<li>Rebalance tenancy laws to provide renters with more security and control, such as eliminating no grounds evictions.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out stamp duty and replace it with a broad-based land tax.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>While there are many opinions on what policy changes will fix the housing market, doing nothing is not an option.</h4>'),(61221,1821,'_solutions_content','field_640e8b307a958'),(61222,1821,'problem_icons_0_prob_icon','1699'),(61223,1821,'_problem_icons_0_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(61224,1821,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','70% highly concerned'),(61225,1821,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(61226,1821,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(61227,1821,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(61228,1821,'problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text',''),(61229,1821,'_problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(61230,1821,'problem_icons','4'),(61231,1821,'_problem_icons','field_640fa0191d518'),(61232,1821,'ceh_content_left',''),(61233,1821,'_ceh_content_left','field_640e97e8f1c8c'),(61234,1821,'ceh_content_right',''),(61235,1821,'_ceh_conte