community\">More about the community</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/about/\">Positives for the area</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"#contact\">Contact us</a>\r\n'),(61397,1822,'_sec_2_button','field_5de6e58c86706'),(61398,1822,'sec_3_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/the-project/\">Detailed project description</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"#location\">Location map</a>'),(61399,1822,'_sec_3_button','field_5de6e5a243c03'),(61400,1822,'page_col_image_4','455'),(61401,1822,'_page_col_image_4','field_5de70801090ce'),(61402,1822,'sec_4_title','Location'),(61403,1822,'_sec_4_title','field_5de7082a12a81'),(61404,1822,'sec_4_text','The project will be located in Central NSW about 5km south-west of the small rural township of Coolah. About 120 wind turbines are being proposed across two clusters at Mount Hope and Black Stump.'),(61405,1822,'_sec_4_text','field_5de7084812a82'),(61406,1822,'sec_4_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/about/\">Detailed location information</a>'),(61407,1822,'_sec_4_button','field_5de7085e12a83'),(61408,1822,'news_title','Project updates'),(61409,1822,'_news_title','field_5de78da3aabb9'),(61410,1822,'sec_2_text_copy',''),(61411,1822,'_sec_2_text_copy','field_5de78dc89e613'),(61412,1822,'timeline-title','Timeline'),(61413,1822,'_timeline-title','field_5de78df29e615'),(61414,1822,'timeline_title','Timeline'),(61415,1822,'_timeline_title','field_5de78df29e615'),(61416,1822,'contact_title','Contact us'),(61417,1822,'_contact_title','field_5de7981e06057'),(61418,1822,'contact_intro','Contact text...'),(61419,1822,'_contact_intro','field_5de7983506058'),(61420,1822,'news_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home btn-news\" href=\"/updates/\">See all updates</a>'),(61421,1822,'_news_button','field_5de8329896e02'),(61422,1822,'timeline_intro','Introduction of timeline detail...'),(61423,1822,'_timeline_intro','field_5de98f5fb1781'),(61424,1822,'timeline_pic','477'),(61425,1822,'_timeline_pic','field_5