with targets and funding for the construction of affordable homes.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out tax breaks for property investors and using the increase in revenue to build more public housing.</li>\r\n 	<li>Establish laws which limit rental increases beyond what is fair.</li>\r\n 	<li>Rebalance tenancy laws to provide renters with more security and control, such as eliminating no grounds evictions.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out stamp duty and replace it with a broad-based land tax.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>While there are many opinions on what policy changes will fix the housing market, doing nothing is not an option.</h4>'),(61819,1822,'_solutions_content','field_640e8b307a958'),(61820,1822,'problem_icons_0_prob_icon','1699'),(61821,1822,'_problem_icons_0_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(61822,1822,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','70% highly concerned'),(61823,1822,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(61824,1822,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(61825,1822,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(61826,1822,'problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text',''),(61827,1822,'_problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(61828,1822,'problem_icons','4'),(61829,1822,'_problem_icons','field_640fa0191d518'),(61830,1822,'ceh_content_left',''),(61831,1822,'_ceh_content_left','field_640e97e8f1c8c'),(61832,1822,'ceh_content_right',''),(61833,1822,'_ceh_content_right','field_640e97fdf1c8d'),(61834,1822,'pc_content_left',''),(61835,1822,'_pc_content_left','field_640e983bf1c8f'),(61836,1822,'pc_content_right',''),(61837,1822,'_pc_content_right','field_640e984df1c90'),(61838,1822,'problem_icons_1_prob_icon','1699'),(61839,1822,'_problem_icons_1_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(61840,1822,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','69% highly concerned'),(61841,1822,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(61842,1822,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(61843,1822,'_prob