porates questions from previous surveys to track trends over time.\r\nThe inaugural poll was conducted by Essential in December 2022, and was completed by 4,735 people.'),(62469,1823,'_monitor_content','field_640fcc4014404'),(62470,1823,'problem_head','Housing in Australia is not working, and Australians are concerned.'),(62471,1823,'_problem_head','field_641935436aded'),(62472,1823,'problem_signoff','Explore the research showing how concerned Australians are our about the housing situation.'),(62473,1823,'_problem_signoff','field_641935626adee'),(62474,1823,'sections','a:2:{i:0;s:4:\"hero\";i:1;s:9:\"news_grid\";}'),(62475,1823,'_sections','field_5dafb40b8143a'),(62476,1823,'sections_0_is_full_height','1'),(62477,1823,'_sections_0_is_full_height','field_61d6f6fd5a37e'),(62478,1823,'sections_0_image','1648'),(62479,1823,'_sections_0_image','field_61d6f6d45a37d'),(62480,1823,'sections_0_heading','Heading'),(62481,1823,'_sections_0_heading','field_61d6f69e5a379'),(62482,1823,'sections_0_subtitle','Ya ya '),(62483,1823,'_sections_0_subtitle','field_61d6f6ac5a37a'),(62484,1823,'sections_0_link_one',''),(62485,1823,'_sections_0_link_one','field_61d6f6b55a37b'),(62486,1823,'sections_0_link_two',''),(62487,1823,'_sections_0_link_two','field_61d6f6c35a37c'),(62488,1823,'sections_1_select_categories','a:1:{i:0;s:2:\"27\";}'),(62489,1823,'_sections_1_select_categories','field_637f04483b63b'),(62490,1823,'intro_head_major','Queenslanders are known for both our love of the great outdoors and our state pride…'),(62491,1823,'_intro_head_major','field_64e828783ad9f'),(62492,1823,'intro_head_minor','But there’s a few things you might not know about our beautiful state.'),(62493,1823,'_intro_head_minor','field_64e8288c3ada0'),(62494,1823,'intro_icons_0_int_icon','1806'),(62495,1823,'_intro_icons_0_int_icon','field_64e828b33ada2'),(62496,1823,'intro_icons_0_int_icon_text','At 1,727,000 square kilometres, we’re 2.5 times the size of Texas. <span>Yeeha!</span>'),(62497,1823,'_intro_ico