sters at Mount Hope and Black Stump that  will be capable of generating 2,000,000 megawatt hours of clean renewable energy each year.'),(66282,1846,'_sec_3_text','field_5de6e4044e5e8'),(66283,1846,'page_col_image_2','436'),(66284,1846,'_page_col_image_2','field_5de6546e7c63a'),(66285,1846,'sec_2_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/community\">More about the community</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/about/\">Positives for the area</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"#contact\">Contact us</a>\r\n'),(66286,1846,'_sec_2_button','field_5de6e58c86706'),(66287,1846,'sec_3_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/the-project/\">Detailed project description</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"#location\">Location map</a>'),(66288,1846,'_sec_3_button','field_5de6e5a243c03'),(66289,1846,'page_col_image_4','455'),(66290,1846,'_page_col_image_4','field_5de70801090ce'),(66291,1846,'sec_4_title','Location'),(66292,1846,'_sec_4_title','field_5de7082a12a81'),(66293,1846,'sec_4_text','The project will be located in Central NSW about 5km south-west of the small rural township of Coolah. About 120 wind turbines are being proposed across two clusters at Mount Hope and Black Stump.'),(66294,1846,'_sec_4_text','field_5de7084812a82'),(66295,1846,'sec_4_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/about/\">Detailed location information</a>'),(66296,1846,'_sec_4_button','field_5de7085e12a83'),(66297,1846,'news_title','Project updates'),(66298,1846,'_news_title','field_5de78da3aabb9'),(66299,1846,'sec_2_text_copy',''),(66300,1846,'_sec_2_text_copy','field_5de78dc89e613'),(66301,1846,'timeline-title','Timeline'),(66302,1846,'_timeline-title','field_5de78df29e615'),(66303,1846,'timeline_title','Timeline'),(66304,1846,'_timeline_title','field_5de78df29e615'),(66305,1846,'contact_title','Contact us'),(66306,1846,'_contact_title','field_5de7981e06057'),(66307,1846,'contact_intro','Contact text...'),(66308,1846,'_contact_intro','field_5de798350