'field_62f30edfb57e1'),(67919,1851,'report_intro','Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Phasellus massa erat, consectetur at semper at, feugiat vel orci. '),(67920,1851,'_report_intro','field_62f30eedb57e2'),(67921,1851,'report_link_url','#'),(67922,1851,'_report_link_url','field_62f30ef4b57e3'),(67923,1851,'report_link_text','Download'),(67924,1851,'_report_link_text','field_62f30f01b57e4'),(67925,1851,'solutions_content','The housing system is complex, and no one solution will solve the complex problems we now face but there are some critical first steps to be taken now.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Set out an ambitious national housing agreement between commonwealth and state governments with targets and funding for the construction of affordable homes.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out tax breaks for property investors and using the increase in revenue to build more public housing.</li>\r\n 	<li>Establish laws which limit rental increases beyond what is fair.</li>\r\n 	<li>Rebalance tenancy laws to provide renters with more security and control, such as eliminating no grounds evictions.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out stamp duty and replace it with a broad-based land tax.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>While there are many opinions on what policy changes will fix the housing market, doing nothing is not an option.</h4>'),(67926,1851,'_solutions_content','field_640e8b307a958'),(67927,1851,'problem_icons_0_prob_icon','1699'),(67928,1851,'_problem_icons_0_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(67929,1851,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','70% highly concerned'),(67930,1851,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(67931,1851,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(67932,1851,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(67933,1851,'problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text',''),(67934,1851,'_problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(67935,1851,'problem_icons','4'),(67936,1851,'_problem_icons','field_640fa0191d518'),(679