 surveys to track trends over time.\r\nThe inaugural poll was conducted by Essential in December 2022, and was completed by 4,735 people.'),(69205,1853,'_monitor_content','field_640fcc4014404'),(69206,1853,'problem_head','Housing in Australia is not working, and Australians are concerned.'),(69207,1853,'_problem_head','field_641935436aded'),(69208,1853,'problem_signoff','Explore the research showing how concerned Australians are our about the housing situation.'),(69209,1853,'_problem_signoff','field_641935626adee'),(69210,1853,'sections','a:2:{i:0;s:4:\"hero\";i:1;s:9:\"news_grid\";}'),(69211,1853,'_sections','field_5dafb40b8143a'),(69212,1853,'sections_0_is_full_height','1'),(69213,1853,'_sections_0_is_full_height','field_61d6f6fd5a37e'),(69214,1853,'sections_0_image','1648'),(69215,1853,'_sections_0_image','field_61d6f6d45a37d'),(69216,1853,'sections_0_heading','Heading'),(69217,1853,'_sections_0_heading','field_61d6f69e5a379'),(69218,1853,'sections_0_subtitle','Ya ya '),(69219,1853,'_sections_0_subtitle','field_61d6f6ac5a37a'),(69220,1853,'sections_0_link_one',''),(69221,1853,'_sections_0_link_one','field_61d6f6b55a37b'),(69222,1853,'sections_0_link_two',''),(69223,1853,'_sections_0_link_two','field_61d6f6c35a37c'),(69224,1853,'sections_1_select_categories','a:1:{i:0;s:2:\"27\";}'),(69225,1853,'_sections_1_select_categories','field_637f04483b63b'),(69226,1853,'intro_head_major','Queenslanders are known for both our love of the great outdoors and our state pride…'),(69227,1853,'_intro_head_major','field_64e828783ad9f'),(69228,1853,'intro_head_minor','But there’s a few things you might not know about our beautiful state.'),(69229,1853,'_intro_head_minor','field_64e8288c3ada0'),(69230,1853,'intro_icons_0_int_icon','1806'),(69231,1853,'_intro_icons_0_int_icon','field_64e828b33ada2'),(69232,1853,'intro_icons_0_int_icon_text','At 1,727,000 square kilometres, we’re 2.5 times the size of Texas. <span>Yeeha!</span>'),(69233,1853,'_intro_icons_0_int_icon_text','field_64e8