ugural poll was conducted by Essential in December 2022, and was completed by 4,735 people.'),(71105,1859,'_monitor_content','field_640fcc4014404'),(71106,1859,'problem_head','Housing in Australia is not working, and Australians are concerned.'),(71107,1859,'_problem_head','field_641935436aded'),(71108,1859,'problem_signoff','Explore the research showing how concerned Australians are our about the housing situation.'),(71109,1859,'_problem_signoff','field_641935626adee'),(71110,1859,'sections','a:2:{i:0;s:4:\"hero\";i:1;s:9:\"news_grid\";}'),(71111,1859,'_sections','field_5dafb40b8143a'),(71112,1859,'sections_0_is_full_height','1'),(71113,1859,'_sections_0_is_full_height','field_61d6f6fd5a37e'),(71114,1859,'sections_0_image','1648'),(71115,1859,'_sections_0_image','field_61d6f6d45a37d'),(71116,1859,'sections_0_heading','Heading'),(71117,1859,'_sections_0_heading','field_61d6f69e5a379'),(71118,1859,'sections_0_subtitle','Ya ya '),(71119,1859,'_sections_0_subtitle','field_61d6f6ac5a37a'),(71120,1859,'sections_0_link_one',''),(71121,1859,'_sections_0_link_one','field_61d6f6b55a37b'),(71122,1859,'sections_0_link_two',''),(71123,1859,'_sections_0_link_two','field_61d6f6c35a37c'),(71124,1859,'sections_1_select_categories','a:1:{i:0;s:2:\"27\";}'),(71125,1859,'_sections_1_select_categories','field_637f04483b63b'),(71126,1859,'intro_head_major','Queenslanders are known for both our love of the great outdoors and our state pride…'),(71127,1859,'_intro_head_major','field_64e828783ad9f'),(71128,1859,'intro_head_minor','But there’s a few things you might not know about our beautiful state.'),(71129,1859,'_intro_head_minor','field_64e8288c3ada0'),(71130,1859,'intro_icons_0_int_icon','1806'),(71131,1859,'_intro_icons_0_int_icon','field_64e828b33ada2'),(71132,1859,'intro_icons_0_int_icon_text','At 1,727,000 square kilometres, we’re 2.5 times the size of Texas. <span>Yeeha!</span>'),(71133,1859,'_intro_icons_0_int_icon_text','field_64e828e33ada3'),(71134,1859,'intro_icons_1_int_ico