er 2022, and was completed by 4,735 people.'),(71749,1864,'_monitor_content','field_640fcc4014404'),(71750,1864,'problem_head','Housing in Australia is not working, and Australians are concerned.'),(71751,1864,'_problem_head','field_641935436aded'),(71752,1864,'problem_signoff','Explore the research showing how concerned Australians are our about the housing situation.'),(71753,1864,'_problem_signoff','field_641935626adee'),(71754,1864,'sections','a:2:{i:0;s:4:\"hero\";i:1;s:9:\"news_grid\";}'),(71755,1864,'_sections','field_5dafb40b8143a'),(71756,1864,'sections_0_is_full_height','1'),(71757,1864,'_sections_0_is_full_height','field_61d6f6fd5a37e'),(71758,1864,'sections_0_image','1648'),(71759,1864,'_sections_0_image','field_61d6f6d45a37d'),(71760,1864,'sections_0_heading','Heading'),(71761,1864,'_sections_0_heading','field_61d6f69e5a379'),(71762,1864,'sections_0_subtitle','Ya ya '),(71763,1864,'_sections_0_subtitle','field_61d6f6ac5a37a'),(71764,1864,'sections_0_link_one',''),(71765,1864,'_sections_0_link_one','field_61d6f6b55a37b'),(71766,1864,'sections_0_link_two',''),(71767,1864,'_sections_0_link_two','field_61d6f6c35a37c'),(71768,1864,'sections_1_select_categories','a:1:{i:0;s:2:\"27\";}'),(71769,1864,'_sections_1_select_categories','field_637f04483b63b'),(71770,1864,'intro_head_major','Queenslanders are known for both our love of the great outdoors and our state pride…'),(71771,1864,'_intro_head_major','field_64e828783ad9f'),(71772,1864,'intro_head_minor','But there’s a few things you might not know about our beautiful state.'),(71773,1864,'_intro_head_minor','field_64e8288c3ada0'),(71774,1864,'intro_icons_0_int_icon','1806'),(71775,1864,'_intro_icons_0_int_icon','field_64e828b33ada2'),(71776,1864,'intro_icons_0_int_icon_text','At 1,727,000 square kilometres, we’re 2.5 times the size of Texas. <span>Yeeha!</span>'),(71777,1864,'_intro_icons_0_int_icon_text','field_64e828e33ada3'),(71778,1864,'intro_icons_1_int_icon','1806'),(71779,1864,'_intro_icons_1_int_icon'