The inaugural poll was conducted by Essential in December 2022, and was completed by 4,735 people.'),(72395,1865,'_monitor_content','field_640fcc4014404'),(72396,1865,'problem_head','Housing in Australia is not working, and Australians are concerned.'),(72397,1865,'_problem_head','field_641935436aded'),(72398,1865,'problem_signoff','Explore the research showing how concerned Australians are our about the housing situation.'),(72399,1865,'_problem_signoff','field_641935626adee'),(72400,1865,'sections','a:2:{i:0;s:4:\"hero\";i:1;s:9:\"news_grid\";}'),(72401,1865,'_sections','field_5dafb40b8143a'),(72402,1865,'sections_0_is_full_height','1'),(72403,1865,'_sections_0_is_full_height','field_61d6f6fd5a37e'),(72404,1865,'sections_0_image','1648'),(72405,1865,'_sections_0_image','field_61d6f6d45a37d'),(72406,1865,'sections_0_heading','Heading'),(72407,1865,'_sections_0_heading','field_61d6f69e5a379'),(72408,1865,'sections_0_subtitle','Ya ya '),(72409,1865,'_sections_0_subtitle','field_61d6f6ac5a37a'),(72410,1865,'sections_0_link_one',''),(72411,1865,'_sections_0_link_one','field_61d6f6b55a37b'),(72412,1865,'sections_0_link_two',''),(72413,1865,'_sections_0_link_two','field_61d6f6c35a37c'),(72414,1865,'sections_1_select_categories','a:1:{i:0;s:2:\"27\";}'),(72415,1865,'_sections_1_select_categories','field_637f04483b63b'),(72416,1865,'intro_head_major','Queenslanders are known for both our love of the great outdoors and our state pride…'),(72417,1865,'_intro_head_major','field_64e828783ad9f'),(72418,1865,'intro_head_minor','But there’s a few things you might not know about our beautiful state.'),(72419,1865,'_intro_head_minor','field_64e8288c3ada0'),(72420,1865,'intro_icons_0_int_icon','1806'),(72421,1865,'_intro_icons_0_int_icon','field_64e828b33ada2'),(72422,1865,'intro_icons_0_int_icon_text','At 1,727,000 square kilometres, we’re 2.5 times the size of Texas. <span>Yeeha!</span>'),(72423,1865,'_intro_icons_0_int_icon_text','field_64e828e33ada3'),(72424,1865,'intro_icons_1_