what policy changes will fix the housing market, doing nothing is not an option.</h4>'),(72989,1866,'_solutions_content','field_640e8b307a958'),(72990,1866,'problem_icons_0_prob_icon','1699'),(72991,1866,'_problem_icons_0_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(72992,1866,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','70% highly concerned'),(72993,1866,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(72994,1866,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(72995,1866,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(72996,1866,'problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text',''),(72997,1866,'_problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(72998,1866,'problem_icons','4'),(72999,1866,'_problem_icons','field_640fa0191d518'),(73000,1866,'ceh_content_left',''),(73001,1866,'_ceh_content_left','field_640e97e8f1c8c'),(73002,1866,'ceh_content_right',''),(73003,1866,'_ceh_content_right','field_640e97fdf1c8d'),(73004,1866,'pc_content_left',''),(73005,1866,'_pc_content_left','field_640e983bf1c8f'),(73006,1866,'pc_content_right',''),(73007,1866,'_pc_content_right','field_640e984df1c90'),(73008,1866,'problem_icons_1_prob_icon','1699'),(73009,1866,'_problem_icons_1_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(73010,1866,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','69% highly concerned'),(73011,1866,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(73012,1866,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(73013,1866,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(73014,1866,'problem_icons_1_prob_issue_text',''),(73015,1866,'_problem_icons_1_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(73016,1866,'problem_icons_2_prob_icon','1699'),(73017,1866,'_problem_icons_2_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(73018,1866,'problem_icons_2_prob_concerned_stat','64% highly concerned'),(73019,1866,'_problem_icons_2_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(73020,1866,'problem_icons_2_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(73021,1866,'_problem