uestions from previous surveys to track trends over time.\r\nThe inaugural poll was conducted by Essential in December 2022, and was completed by 4,735 people.'),(73041,1866,'_monitor_content','field_640fcc4014404'),(73042,1866,'problem_head','Housing in Australia is not working, and Australians are concerned.'),(73043,1866,'_problem_head','field_641935436aded'),(73044,1866,'problem_signoff','Explore the research showing how concerned Australians are our about the housing situation.'),(73045,1866,'_problem_signoff','field_641935626adee'),(73046,1866,'sections','a:2:{i:0;s:4:\"hero\";i:1;s:9:\"news_grid\";}'),(73047,1866,'_sections','field_5dafb40b8143a'),(73048,1866,'sections_0_is_full_height','1'),(73049,1866,'_sections_0_is_full_height','field_61d6f6fd5a37e'),(73050,1866,'sections_0_image','1648'),(73051,1866,'_sections_0_image','field_61d6f6d45a37d'),(73052,1866,'sections_0_heading','Heading'),(73053,1866,'_sections_0_heading','field_61d6f69e5a379'),(73054,1866,'sections_0_subtitle','Ya ya '),(73055,1866,'_sections_0_subtitle','field_61d6f6ac5a37a'),(73056,1866,'sections_0_link_one',''),(73057,1866,'_sections_0_link_one','field_61d6f6b55a37b'),(73058,1866,'sections_0_link_two',''),(73059,1866,'_sections_0_link_two','field_61d6f6c35a37c'),(73060,1866,'sections_1_select_categories','a:1:{i:0;s:2:\"27\";}'),(73061,1866,'_sections_1_select_categories','field_637f04483b63b'),(73062,1866,'intro_head_major','Queenslanders are known for both our love of the great outdoors and our state pride…'),(73063,1866,'_intro_head_major','field_64e828783ad9f'),(73064,1866,'intro_head_minor','But there’s a few things you might not know about our beautiful state.'),(73065,1866,'_intro_head_minor','field_64e8288c3ada0'),(73066,1866,'intro_icons_0_int_icon','1806'),(73067,1866,'_intro_icons_0_int_icon','field_64e828b33ada2'),(73068,1866,'intro_icons_0_int_icon_text','At 1,727,000 square kilometres, we’re 2.5 times the size of Texas. <span>Yeeha!</span>'),(73069,1866,'_intro_icons_0_int_