nd tax.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>While there are many opinions on what policy changes will fix the housing market, doing nothing is not an option.</h4>'),(73635,1867,'_solutions_content','field_640e8b307a958'),(73636,1867,'problem_icons_0_prob_icon','1699'),(73637,1867,'_problem_icons_0_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(73638,1867,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','70% highly concerned'),(73639,1867,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(73640,1867,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(73641,1867,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(73642,1867,'problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text',''),(73643,1867,'_problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(73644,1867,'problem_icons','4'),(73645,1867,'_problem_icons','field_640fa0191d518'),(73646,1867,'ceh_content_left',''),(73647,1867,'_ceh_content_left','field_640e97e8f1c8c'),(73648,1867,'ceh_content_right',''),(73649,1867,'_ceh_content_right','field_640e97fdf1c8d'),(73650,1867,'pc_content_left',''),(73651,1867,'_pc_content_left','field_640e983bf1c8f'),(73652,1867,'pc_content_right',''),(73653,1867,'_pc_content_right','field_640e984df1c90'),(73654,1867,'problem_icons_1_prob_icon','1699'),(73655,1867,'_problem_icons_1_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(73656,1867,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','69% highly concerned'),(73657,1867,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(73658,1867,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(73659,1867,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(73660,1867,'problem_icons_1_prob_issue_text',''),(73661,1867,'_problem_icons_1_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(73662,1867,'problem_icons_2_prob_icon','1699'),(73663,1867,'_problem_icons_2_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(73664,1867,'problem_icons_2_prob_concerned_stat','64% highly concerned'),(73665,1867,'_problem_icons_2_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(73666,1867,'problem_icons_2_prob