y of opinion around the country.\r\n\r\nIt also incorporates questions from previous surveys to track trends over time.\r\nThe inaugural poll was conducted by Essential in December 2022, and was completed by 4,735 people.'),(73687,1867,'_monitor_content','field_640fcc4014404'),(73688,1867,'problem_head','Housing in Australia is not working, and Australians are concerned.'),(73689,1867,'_problem_head','field_641935436aded'),(73690,1867,'problem_signoff','Explore the research showing how concerned Australians are our about the housing situation.'),(73691,1867,'_problem_signoff','field_641935626adee'),(73692,1867,'sections','a:2:{i:0;s:4:\"hero\";i:1;s:9:\"news_grid\";}'),(73693,1867,'_sections','field_5dafb40b8143a'),(73694,1867,'sections_0_is_full_height','1'),(73695,1867,'_sections_0_is_full_height','field_61d6f6fd5a37e'),(73696,1867,'sections_0_image','1648'),(73697,1867,'_sections_0_image','field_61d6f6d45a37d'),(73698,1867,'sections_0_heading','Heading'),(73699,1867,'_sections_0_heading','field_61d6f69e5a379'),(73700,1867,'sections_0_subtitle','Ya ya '),(73701,1867,'_sections_0_subtitle','field_61d6f6ac5a37a'),(73702,1867,'sections_0_link_one',''),(73703,1867,'_sections_0_link_one','field_61d6f6b55a37b'),(73704,1867,'sections_0_link_two',''),(73705,1867,'_sections_0_link_two','field_61d6f6c35a37c'),(73706,1867,'sections_1_select_categories','a:1:{i:0;s:2:\"27\";}'),(73707,1867,'_sections_1_select_categories','field_637f04483b63b'),(73708,1867,'intro_head_major','Queenslanders are known for both our love of the great outdoors and our state pride…'),(73709,1867,'_intro_head_major','field_64e828783ad9f'),(73710,1867,'intro_head_minor','But there’s a few things you might not know about our beautiful state.'),(73711,1867,'_intro_head_minor','field_64e8288c3ada0'),(73712,1867,'intro_icons_0_int_icon','1806'),(73713,1867,'_intro_icons_0_int_icon','field_64e828b33ada2'),(73714,1867,'intro_icons_0_int_icon_text','At 1,727,000 square kilometres, we’re 2.5 times the size of