ean/the-project/\">Detailed project description</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"#location\">Location map</a>'),(75153,1870,'_sec_3_button','field_5de6e5a243c03'),(75154,1870,'page_col_image_4','455'),(75155,1870,'_page_col_image_4','field_5de70801090ce'),(75156,1870,'sec_4_title','Location'),(75157,1870,'_sec_4_title','field_5de7082a12a81'),(75158,1870,'sec_4_text','The project will be located in Central NSW about 5km south-west of the small rural township of Coolah. About 120 wind turbines are being proposed across two clusters at Mount Hope and Black Stump.'),(75159,1870,'_sec_4_text','field_5de7084812a82'),(75160,1870,'sec_4_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/about/\">Detailed location information</a>'),(75161,1870,'_sec_4_button','field_5de7085e12a83'),(75162,1870,'news_title','Project updates'),(75163,1870,'_news_title','field_5de78da3aabb9'),(75164,1870,'sec_2_text_copy',''),(75165,1870,'_sec_2_text_copy','field_5de78dc89e613'),(75166,1870,'timeline-title','Timeline'),(75167,1870,'_timeline-title','field_5de78df29e615'),(75168,1870,'timeline_title','Timeline'),(75169,1870,'_timeline_title','field_5de78df29e615'),(75170,1870,'contact_title','Contact us'),(75171,1870,'_contact_title','field_5de7981e06057'),(75172,1870,'contact_intro','Contact text...'),(75173,1870,'_contact_intro','field_5de7983506058'),(75174,1870,'news_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home btn-news\" href=\"/updates/\">See all updates</a>'),(75175,1870,'_news_button','field_5de8329896e02'),(75176,1870,'timeline_intro','Introduction of timeline detail...'),(75177,1870,'_timeline_intro','field_5de98f5fb1781'),(75178,1870,'timeline_pic','477'),(75179,1870,'_timeline_pic','field_5de98f72b1782'),(75180,1870,'timeline_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home btn-news\" href=\"/about/\">Detailed timeline</a>'),(75181,1870,'_timeline_button','field_5de99363677f8'),(75182,1870,'banner_image_position','center'),(75183,1870,'_banner_image_position','field_5f3bc4757dd02'),(75184,1870,'services_t