ns are our about the housing situation.'),(77567,1873,'_problem_signoff','field_641935626adee'),(77568,1873,'sections','a:2:{i:0;s:4:\"hero\";i:1;s:9:\"news_grid\";}'),(77569,1873,'_sections','field_5dafb40b8143a'),(77570,1873,'sections_0_is_full_height','1'),(77571,1873,'_sections_0_is_full_height','field_61d6f6fd5a37e'),(77572,1873,'sections_0_image','1648'),(77573,1873,'_sections_0_image','field_61d6f6d45a37d'),(77574,1873,'sections_0_heading','Heading'),(77575,1873,'_sections_0_heading','field_61d6f69e5a379'),(77576,1873,'sections_0_subtitle','Ya ya '),(77577,1873,'_sections_0_subtitle','field_61d6f6ac5a37a'),(77578,1873,'sections_0_link_one',''),(77579,1873,'_sections_0_link_one','field_61d6f6b55a37b'),(77580,1873,'sections_0_link_two',''),(77581,1873,'_sections_0_link_two','field_61d6f6c35a37c'),(77582,1873,'sections_1_select_categories','a:1:{i:0;s:2:\"27\";}'),(77583,1873,'_sections_1_select_categories','field_637f04483b63b'),(77584,1873,'intro_head_major','Queenslanders are known for both our love of the great outdoors and our state pride…'),(77585,1873,'_intro_head_major','field_64e828783ad9f'),(77586,1873,'intro_head_minor','But there’s a few things you might not know about our beautiful state.'),(77587,1873,'_intro_head_minor','field_64e8288c3ada0'),(77588,1873,'intro_icons_0_int_icon','1806'),(77589,1873,'_intro_icons_0_int_icon','field_64e828b33ada2'),(77590,1873,'intro_icons_0_int_icon_text','At 1,727,000 square kilometres, we’re 2.5 times the size of Texas. <span>Yeeha!</span>'),(77591,1873,'_intro_icons_0_int_icon_text','field_64e828e33ada3'),(77592,1873,'intro_icons_1_int_icon','1806'),(77593,1873,'_intro_icons_1_int_icon','field_64e828b33ada2'),(77594,1873,'intro_icons_1_int_icon_text','We have twice as many species of native plant and animal as any other Australian state or territory.'),(77595,1873,'_intro_icons_1_int_icon_text','field_64e828e33ada3'),(77596,1873,'intro_icons_2_int_icon','1806'),(77597,1873,'_intro_icons_2_int_icon','field_64e828