ver time.\r\nThe inaugural poll was conducted by Essential in December 2022, and was completed by 4,735 people.'),(78211,1875,'_monitor_content','field_640fcc4014404'),(78212,1875,'problem_head','Housing in Australia is not working, and Australians are concerned.'),(78213,1875,'_problem_head','field_641935436aded'),(78214,1875,'problem_signoff','Explore the research showing how concerned Australians are our about the housing situation.'),(78215,1875,'_problem_signoff','field_641935626adee'),(78216,1875,'sections','a:2:{i:0;s:4:\"hero\";i:1;s:9:\"news_grid\";}'),(78217,1875,'_sections','field_5dafb40b8143a'),(78218,1875,'sections_0_is_full_height','1'),(78219,1875,'_sections_0_is_full_height','field_61d6f6fd5a37e'),(78220,1875,'sections_0_image','1648'),(78221,1875,'_sections_0_image','field_61d6f6d45a37d'),(78222,1875,'sections_0_heading','Heading'),(78223,1875,'_sections_0_heading','field_61d6f69e5a379'),(78224,1875,'sections_0_subtitle','Ya ya '),(78225,1875,'_sections_0_subtitle','field_61d6f6ac5a37a'),(78226,1875,'sections_0_link_one',''),(78227,1875,'_sections_0_link_one','field_61d6f6b55a37b'),(78228,1875,'sections_0_link_two',''),(78229,1875,'_sections_0_link_two','field_61d6f6c35a37c'),(78230,1875,'sections_1_select_categories','a:1:{i:0;s:2:\"27\";}'),(78231,1875,'_sections_1_select_categories','field_637f04483b63b'),(78232,1875,'intro_head_major','Queenslanders are known for both our love of the great outdoors and our state pride…'),(78233,1875,'_intro_head_major','field_64e828783ad9f'),(78234,1875,'intro_head_minor','But there’s a few things you might not know about our beautiful state.'),(78235,1875,'_intro_head_minor','field_64e8288c3ada0'),(78236,1875,'intro_icons_0_int_icon','1806'),(78237,1875,'_intro_icons_0_int_icon','field_64e828b33ada2'),(78238,1875,'intro_icons_0_int_icon_text','At 1,727,000 square kilometres, we’re 2.5 times the size of Texas. <span>Yeeha!</span>'),(78239,1875,'_intro_icons_0_int_icon_text','field_64e828e33ada3'),(78240,1875,'i