 housing.</li>\r\n 	<li>Establish laws which limit rental increases beyond what is fair.</li>\r\n 	<li>Rebalance tenancy laws to provide renters with more security and control, such as eliminating no grounds evictions.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out stamp duty and replace it with a broad-based land tax.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>While there are many opinions on what policy changes will fix the housing market, doing nothing is not an option.</h4>'),(78805,1876,'_solutions_content','field_640e8b307a958'),(78806,1876,'problem_icons_0_prob_icon','1699'),(78807,1876,'_problem_icons_0_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(78808,1876,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','70% highly concerned'),(78809,1876,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(78810,1876,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(78811,1876,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(78812,1876,'problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text',''),(78813,1876,'_problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(78814,1876,'problem_icons','4'),(78815,1876,'_problem_icons','field_640fa0191d518'),(78816,1876,'ceh_content_left',''),(78817,1876,'_ceh_content_left','field_640e97e8f1c8c'),(78818,1876,'ceh_content_right',''),(78819,1876,'_ceh_content_right','field_640e97fdf1c8d'),(78820,1876,'pc_content_left',''),(78821,1876,'_pc_content_left','field_640e983bf1c8f'),(78822,1876,'pc_content_right',''),(78823,1876,'_pc_content_right','field_640e984df1c90'),(78824,1876,'problem_icons_1_prob_icon','1699'),(78825,1876,'_problem_icons_1_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(78826,1876,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','69% highly concerned'),(78827,1876,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(78828,1876,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(78829,1876,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(78830,1876,'problem_icons_1_prob_issue_text',''),(78831,1876,'_problem_icons_1_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(78