','field_6294562942237'),(79501,1893,'survey_index_7_survey_title','Going Off-grid'),(79502,1893,'_survey_index_7_survey_title','field_6294564042238'),(79503,1893,'survey_index_7_survey_url','#'),(79504,1893,'_survey_index_7_survey_url','field_6294564e42239'),(79505,1893,'survey_index_7_survey_url_text','View Results'),(79506,1893,'_survey_index_7_survey_url_text','field_629456584223a'),(79507,1893,'survey_index','8'),(79508,1893,'_survey_index','field_6294561242236'),(79509,1893,'report_title','Download the report'),(79510,1893,'_report_title','field_62f30edfb57e1'),(79511,1893,'report_intro','Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Phasellus massa erat, consectetur at semper at, feugiat vel orci. '),(79512,1893,'_report_intro','field_62f30eedb57e2'),(79513,1893,'report_link_url','#'),(79514,1893,'_report_link_url','field_62f30ef4b57e3'),(79515,1893,'report_link_text','Download'),(79516,1893,'_report_link_text','field_62f30f01b57e4'),(79517,1893,'solutions_content','The housing system is complex, and no one solution will solve the complex problems we now face but there are some critical first steps to be taken now.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Set out an ambitious national housing agreement between commonwealth and state governments with targets and funding for the construction of affordable homes.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out tax breaks for property investors and using the increase in revenue to build more public housing.</li>\r\n 	<li>Establish laws which limit rental increases beyond what is fair.</li>\r\n 	<li>Rebalance tenancy laws to provide renters with more security and control, such as eliminating no grounds evictions.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out stamp duty and replace it with a broad-based land tax.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>While there are many opinions on what policy changes will fix the housing market, doing nothing is not an option.</h4>'),(79518,1893,'_solutions_content','field_640e8b307a958'),(79519,1893,'problem_icons_0_prob_icon','1699'),(79520,1893,'_prob