 around the country.\r\n\r\nIt also incorporates questions from previous surveys to track trends over time.\r\nThe inaugural poll was conducted by Essential in December 2022, and was completed by 4,735 people.'),(80216,1894,'_monitor_content','field_640fcc4014404'),(80217,1894,'problem_head','Housing in Australia is not working, and Australians are concerned.'),(80218,1894,'_problem_head','field_641935436aded'),(80219,1894,'problem_signoff','Explore the research showing how concerned Australians are our about the housing situation.'),(80220,1894,'_problem_signoff','field_641935626adee'),(80221,1894,'sections','a:2:{i:0;s:4:\"hero\";i:1;s:9:\"news_grid\";}'),(80222,1894,'_sections','field_5dafb40b8143a'),(80223,1894,'sections_0_is_full_height','1'),(80224,1894,'_sections_0_is_full_height','field_61d6f6fd5a37e'),(80225,1894,'sections_0_image','1648'),(80226,1894,'_sections_0_image','field_61d6f6d45a37d'),(80227,1894,'sections_0_heading','Heading'),(80228,1894,'_sections_0_heading','field_61d6f69e5a379'),(80229,1894,'sections_0_subtitle','Ya ya '),(80230,1894,'_sections_0_subtitle','field_61d6f6ac5a37a'),(80231,1894,'sections_0_link_one',''),(80232,1894,'_sections_0_link_one','field_61d6f6b55a37b'),(80233,1894,'sections_0_link_two',''),(80234,1894,'_sections_0_link_two','field_61d6f6c35a37c'),(80235,1894,'sections_1_select_categories','a:1:{i:0;s:2:\"27\";}'),(80236,1894,'_sections_1_select_categories','field_637f04483b63b'),(80237,1894,'intro_head_major','Queenslanders are known for both our love of the great outdoors and our state pride…'),(80238,1894,'_intro_head_major','field_64e828783ad9f'),(80239,1894,'intro_head_minor','But there’s a few things you might not know about our beautiful state.'),(80240,1894,'_intro_head_minor','field_64e8288c3ada0'),(80241,1894,'intro_icons_0_int_icon',''),(80242,1894,'_intro_icons_0_int_icon','field_64e828b33ada2'),(80243,1894,'intro_icons_0_int_icon_text','At 1,727,000 square kilometres, we’re 2.5 times the size of Texas. <span>Ye