an ambitious national housing agreement between commonwealth and state governments with targets and funding for the construction of affordable homes.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out tax breaks for property investors and using the increase in revenue to build more public housing.</li>\r\n 	<li>Establish laws which limit rental increases beyond what is fair.</li>\r\n 	<li>Rebalance tenancy laws to provide renters with more security and control, such as eliminating no grounds evictions.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out stamp duty and replace it with a broad-based land tax.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>While there are many opinions on what policy changes will fix the housing market, doing nothing is not an option.</h4>'),(80845,1913,'_solutions_content','field_640e8b307a958'),(80846,1913,'problem_icons_0_prob_icon','1699'),(80847,1913,'_problem_icons_0_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(80848,1913,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','70% highly concerned'),(80849,1913,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(80850,1913,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(80851,1913,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(80852,1913,'problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text',''),(80853,1913,'_problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(80854,1913,'problem_icons','4'),(80855,1913,'_problem_icons','field_640fa0191d518'),(80856,1913,'ceh_content_left',''),(80857,1913,'_ceh_content_left','field_640e97e8f1c8c'),(80858,1913,'ceh_content_right',''),(80859,1913,'_ceh_content_right','field_640e97fdf1c8d'),(80860,1913,'pc_content_left',''),(80861,1913,'_pc_content_left','field_640e983bf1c8f'),(80862,1913,'pc_content_right',''),(80863,1913,'_pc_content_right','field_640e984df1c90'),(80864,1913,'problem_icons_1_prob_icon','1699'),(80865,1913,'_problem_icons_1_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(80866,1913,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','69% highly concerned'),(80867,1913,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(80868,19