hat is fair.</li>\r\n 	<li>Rebalance tenancy laws to provide renters with more security and control, such as eliminating no grounds evictions.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out stamp duty and replace it with a broad-based land tax.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>While there are many opinions on what policy changes will fix the housing market, doing nothing is not an option.</h4>'),(81517,1914,'_solutions_content','field_640e8b307a958'),(81518,1914,'problem_icons_0_prob_icon','1699'),(81519,1914,'_problem_icons_0_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(81520,1914,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','70% highly concerned'),(81521,1914,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(81522,1914,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(81523,1914,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(81524,1914,'problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text',''),(81525,1914,'_problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(81526,1914,'problem_icons','4'),(81527,1914,'_problem_icons','field_640fa0191d518'),(81528,1914,'ceh_content_left',''),(81529,1914,'_ceh_content_left','field_640e97e8f1c8c'),(81530,1914,'ceh_content_right',''),(81531,1914,'_ceh_content_right','field_640e97fdf1c8d'),(81532,1914,'pc_content_left',''),(81533,1914,'_pc_content_left','field_640e983bf1c8f'),(81534,1914,'pc_content_right',''),(81535,1914,'_pc_content_right','field_640e984df1c90'),(81536,1914,'problem_icons_1_prob_icon','1699'),(81537,1914,'_problem_icons_1_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(81538,1914,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','69% highly concerned'),(81539,1914,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(81540,1914,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(81541,1914,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(81542,1914,'problem_icons_1_prob_issue_text',''),(81543,1914,'_problem_icons_1_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(81544,1914,'problem_icons_2_prob_icon','1699'),(81545,1914,'_problem_icons_2_p