\r\nThe inaugural poll was conducted by Essential in December 2022, and was completed by 4,735 people.'),(82241,1915,'_monitor_content','field_640fcc4014404'),(82242,1915,'problem_head','Housing in Australia is not working, and Australians are concerned.'),(82243,1915,'_problem_head','field_641935436aded'),(82244,1915,'problem_signoff','Explore the research showing how concerned Australians are our about the housing situation.'),(82245,1915,'_problem_signoff','field_641935626adee'),(82246,1915,'sections','a:2:{i:0;s:4:\"hero\";i:1;s:9:\"news_grid\";}'),(82247,1915,'_sections','field_5dafb40b8143a'),(82248,1915,'sections_0_is_full_height','1'),(82249,1915,'_sections_0_is_full_height','field_61d6f6fd5a37e'),(82250,1915,'sections_0_image','1648'),(82251,1915,'_sections_0_image','field_61d6f6d45a37d'),(82252,1915,'sections_0_heading','Heading'),(82253,1915,'_sections_0_heading','field_61d6f69e5a379'),(82254,1915,'sections_0_subtitle','Ya ya '),(82255,1915,'_sections_0_subtitle','field_61d6f6ac5a37a'),(82256,1915,'sections_0_link_one',''),(82257,1915,'_sections_0_link_one','field_61d6f6b55a37b'),(82258,1915,'sections_0_link_two',''),(82259,1915,'_sections_0_link_two','field_61d6f6c35a37c'),(82260,1915,'sections_1_select_categories','a:1:{i:0;s:2:\"27\";}'),(82261,1915,'_sections_1_select_categories','field_637f04483b63b'),(82262,1915,'intro_head_major','Queenslanders are known for both our love of the great outdoors and our state pride…'),(82263,1915,'_intro_head_major','field_64e828783ad9f'),(82264,1915,'intro_head_minor','But there’s a few things you might not know about our beautiful state.'),(82265,1915,'_intro_head_minor','field_64e8288c3ada0'),(82266,1915,'intro_icons_0_int_icon',''),(82267,1915,'_intro_icons_0_int_icon','field_64e828b33ada2'),(82268,1915,'intro_icons_0_int_icon_text','At 1,727,000 square kilometres, we’re 2.5 times the size of Texas. <span>Yeeha!</span>'),(82269,1915,'_intro_icons_0_int_icon_text','field_64e828e33ada3'),(82270,1915,'intro_icons_1_