'field_62f30eedb57e2'),(84872,1919,'report_link_url','#'),(84873,1919,'_report_link_url','field_62f30ef4b57e3'),(84874,1919,'report_link_text','Download'),(84875,1919,'_report_link_text','field_62f30f01b57e4'),(84876,1919,'solutions_content','The housing system is complex, and no one solution will solve the complex problems we now face but there are some critical first steps to be taken now.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Set out an ambitious national housing agreement between commonwealth and state governments with targets and funding for the construction of affordable homes.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out tax breaks for property investors and using the increase in revenue to build more public housing.</li>\r\n 	<li>Establish laws which limit rental increases beyond what is fair.</li>\r\n 	<li>Rebalance tenancy laws to provide renters with more security and control, such as eliminating no grounds evictions.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out stamp duty and replace it with a broad-based land tax.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>While there are many opinions on what policy changes will fix the housing market, doing nothing is not an option.</h4>'),(84877,1919,'_solutions_content','field_640e8b307a958'),(84878,1919,'problem_icons_0_prob_icon','1699'),(84879,1919,'_problem_icons_0_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(84880,1919,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','70% highly concerned'),(84881,1919,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(84882,1919,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(84883,1919,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(84884,1919,'problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text',''),(84885,1919,'_problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(84886,1919,'problem_icons','4'),(84887,1919,'_problem_icons','field_640fa0191d518'),(84888,1919,'ceh_content_left',''),(84889,1919,'_ceh_content_left','field_640e97e8f1c8c'),(84890,1919,'ceh_content_right',''),(84891,1919,'_ceh_content_right','field_640e97fdf1c8d'),(84892,1919,'pc_content_lef