s two clusters at Mount Hope and Black Stump that  will be capable of generating 2,000,000 megawatt hours of clean renewable energy each year.'),(85801,1924,'_sec_3_text','field_5de6e4044e5e8'),(85802,1924,'page_col_image_2','436'),(85803,1924,'_page_col_image_2','field_5de6546e7c63a'),(85804,1924,'sec_2_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/community\">More about the community</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/about/\">Positives for the area</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"#contact\">Contact us</a>\r\n'),(85805,1924,'_sec_2_button','field_5de6e58c86706'),(85806,1924,'sec_3_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/the-project/\">Detailed project description</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"#location\">Location map</a>'),(85807,1924,'_sec_3_button','field_5de6e5a243c03'),(85808,1924,'page_col_image_4','455'),(85809,1924,'_page_col_image_4','field_5de70801090ce'),(85810,1924,'sec_4_title','Location'),(85811,1924,'_sec_4_title','field_5de7082a12a81'),(85812,1924,'sec_4_text','The project will be located in Central NSW about 5km south-west of the small rural township of Coolah. About 120 wind turbines are being proposed across two clusters at Mount Hope and Black Stump.'),(85813,1924,'_sec_4_text','field_5de7084812a82'),(85814,1924,'sec_4_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/about/\">Detailed location information</a>'),(85815,1924,'_sec_4_button','field_5de7085e12a83'),(85816,1924,'news_title','Project updates'),(85817,1924,'_news_title','field_5de78da3aabb9'),(85818,1924,'sec_2_text_copy',''),(85819,1924,'_sec_2_text_copy','field_5de78dc89e613'),(85820,1924,'timeline-title','Timeline'),(85821,1924,'_timeline-title','field_5de78df29e615'),(85822,1924,'timeline_title','Timeline'),(85823,1924,'_timeline_title','field_5de78df29e615'),(85824,1924,'contact_title','Contact us'),(85825,1924,'_contact_title','field_5de7981e06057'),(85826,1924,'contact_intro','Contact text...'),(85827,1924,'_contact_intro','field_