apable of generating 2,000,000 megawatt hours of clean renewable energy each year.'),(86479,1928,'_sec_3_text','field_5de6e4044e5e8'),(86480,1928,'page_col_image_2','436'),(86481,1928,'_page_col_image_2','field_5de6546e7c63a'),(86482,1928,'sec_2_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/community\">More about the community</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/about/\">Positives for the area</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"#contact\">Contact us</a>\r\n'),(86483,1928,'_sec_2_button','field_5de6e58c86706'),(86484,1928,'sec_3_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/the-project/\">Detailed project description</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"#location\">Location map</a>'),(86485,1928,'_sec_3_button','field_5de6e5a243c03'),(86486,1928,'page_col_image_4','455'),(86487,1928,'_page_col_image_4','field_5de70801090ce'),(86488,1928,'sec_4_title','Location'),(86489,1928,'_sec_4_title','field_5de7082a12a81'),(86490,1928,'sec_4_text','The project will be located in Central NSW about 5km south-west of the small rural township of Coolah. About 120 wind turbines are being proposed across two clusters at Mount Hope and Black Stump.'),(86491,1928,'_sec_4_text','field_5de7084812a82'),(86492,1928,'sec_4_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/about/\">Detailed location information</a>'),(86493,1928,'_sec_4_button','field_5de7085e12a83'),(86494,1928,'news_title','Project updates'),(86495,1928,'_news_title','field_5de78da3aabb9'),(86496,1928,'sec_2_text_copy',''),(86497,1928,'_sec_2_text_copy','field_5de78dc89e613'),(86498,1928,'timeline-title','Timeline'),(86499,1928,'_timeline-title','field_5de78df29e615'),(86500,1928,'timeline_title','Timeline'),(86501,1928,'_timeline_title','field_5de78df29e615'),(86502,1928,'contact_title','Contact us'),(86503,1928,'_contact_title','field_5de7981e06057'),(86504,1928,'contact_intro','Contact text...'),(86505,1928,'_contact_intro','field_5de7983506058'),(86506,1928,'news_button','<a class=\"btn bt