 energy each year.'),(87151,1929,'_sec_3_text','field_5de6e4044e5e8'),(87152,1929,'page_col_image_2','436'),(87153,1929,'_page_col_image_2','field_5de6546e7c63a'),(87154,1929,'sec_2_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/community\">More about the community</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/about/\">Positives for the area</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"#contact\">Contact us</a>\r\n'),(87155,1929,'_sec_2_button','field_5de6e58c86706'),(87156,1929,'sec_3_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/the-project/\">Detailed project description</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"#location\">Location map</a>'),(87157,1929,'_sec_3_button','field_5de6e5a243c03'),(87158,1929,'page_col_image_4','455'),(87159,1929,'_page_col_image_4','field_5de70801090ce'),(87160,1929,'sec_4_title','Location'),(87161,1929,'_sec_4_title','field_5de7082a12a81'),(87162,1929,'sec_4_text','The project will be located in Central NSW about 5km south-west of the small rural township of Coolah. About 120 wind turbines are being proposed across two clusters at Mount Hope and Black Stump.'),(87163,1929,'_sec_4_text','field_5de7084812a82'),(87164,1929,'sec_4_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/about/\">Detailed location information</a>'),(87165,1929,'_sec_4_button','field_5de7085e12a83'),(87166,1929,'news_title','Project updates'),(87167,1929,'_news_title','field_5de78da3aabb9'),(87168,1929,'sec_2_text_copy',''),(87169,1929,'_sec_2_text_copy','field_5de78dc89e613'),(87170,1929,'timeline-title','Timeline'),(87171,1929,'_timeline-title','field_5de78df29e615'),(87172,1929,'timeline_title','Timeline'),(87173,1929,'_timeline_title','field_5de78df29e615'),(87174,1929,'contact_title','Contact us'),(87175,1929,'_contact_title','field_5de7981e06057'),(87176,1929,'contact_intro','Contact text...'),(87177,1929,'_contact_intro','field_5de7983506058'),(87178,1929,'news_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home btn-news\" href=\"/updates/\">See all updates</a>'),(8717