 now face but there are some critical first steps to be taken now.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Set out an ambitious national housing agreement between commonwealth and state governments with targets and funding for the construction of affordable homes.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out tax breaks for property investors and using the increase in revenue to build more public housing.</li>\r\n 	<li>Establish laws which limit rental increases beyond what is fair.</li>\r\n 	<li>Rebalance tenancy laws to provide renters with more security and control, such as eliminating no grounds evictions.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out stamp duty and replace it with a broad-based land tax.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>While there are many opinions on what policy changes will fix the housing market, doing nothing is not an option.</h4>'),(88257,1931,'_solutions_content','field_640e8b307a958'),(88258,1931,'problem_icons_0_prob_icon','1699'),(88259,1931,'_problem_icons_0_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(88260,1931,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','70% highly concerned'),(88261,1931,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(88262,1931,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(88263,1931,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(88264,1931,'problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text',''),(88265,1931,'_problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(88266,1931,'problem_icons','4'),(88267,1931,'_problem_icons','field_640fa0191d518'),(88268,1931,'ceh_content_left',''),(88269,1931,'_ceh_content_left','field_640e97e8f1c8c'),(88270,1931,'ceh_content_right',''),(88271,1931,'_ceh_content_right','field_640e97fdf1c8d'),(88272,1931,'pc_content_left',''),(88273,1931,'_pc_content_left','field_640e983bf1c8f'),(88274,1931,'pc_content_right',''),(88275,1931,'_pc_content_right','field_640e984df1c90'),(88276,1931,'problem_icons_1_prob_icon','1699'),(88277,1931,'_problem_icons_1_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(88278,1931,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','69% highly con