ians are our about the housing situation.'),(90343,1938,'_problem_signoff','field_641935626adee'),(90344,1938,'sections','a:2:{i:0;s:4:\"hero\";i:1;s:9:\"news_grid\";}'),(90345,1938,'_sections','field_5dafb40b8143a'),(90346,1938,'sections_0_is_full_height','1'),(90347,1938,'_sections_0_is_full_height','field_61d6f6fd5a37e'),(90348,1938,'sections_0_image','1648'),(90349,1938,'_sections_0_image','field_61d6f6d45a37d'),(90350,1938,'sections_0_heading','Heading'),(90351,1938,'_sections_0_heading','field_61d6f69e5a379'),(90352,1938,'sections_0_subtitle','Ya ya '),(90353,1938,'_sections_0_subtitle','field_61d6f6ac5a37a'),(90354,1938,'sections_0_link_one',''),(90355,1938,'_sections_0_link_one','field_61d6f6b55a37b'),(90356,1938,'sections_0_link_two',''),(90357,1938,'_sections_0_link_two','field_61d6f6c35a37c'),(90358,1938,'sections_1_select_categories','a:1:{i:0;s:2:\"27\";}'),(90359,1938,'_sections_1_select_categories','field_637f04483b63b'),(90360,1938,'intro_head_major','Super Consumers Australia is <span>fighting</span> to ensure that the superannuation industry is <span>held accountable</span> for the outcomes they deliver to Australian consumers.'),(90361,1938,'_intro_head_major','field_64e828783ad9f'),(90362,1938,'intro_head_minor','We want super to work for everyone—not just super fund companies. With our research, journalism and campaigns we are creating the trustworthy and transparent superannuation system we all deserve.'),(90363,1938,'_intro_head_minor','field_64e8288c3ada0'),(90364,1938,'intro_icons_0_int_icon','1922'),(90365,1938,'_intro_icons_0_int_icon','field_64e828b33ada2'),(90366,1938,'intro_icons_0_int_icon_text','At 1,727,000 square kilometres, we’re 2.5 times the size of Texas. <span>Yeeha!</span>'),(90367,1938,'_intro_icons_0_int_icon_text','field_64e828e33ada3'),(90368,1938,'intro_icons_1_int_icon','1920'),(90369,1938,'_intro_icons_1_int_icon','field_64e828b33ada2'),(90370,1938,'intro_icons_1_int_icon_text','We have twice as many species of native p