m_head','Housing in Australia is not working, and Australians are concerned.'),(92359,1942,'_problem_head','field_641935436aded'),(92360,1942,'problem_signoff','Explore the research showing how concerned Australians are our about the housing situation.'),(92361,1942,'_problem_signoff','field_641935626adee'),(92362,1942,'sections','a:2:{i:0;s:4:\"hero\";i:1;s:9:\"news_grid\";}'),(92363,1942,'_sections','field_5dafb40b8143a'),(92364,1942,'sections_0_is_full_height','1'),(92365,1942,'_sections_0_is_full_height','field_61d6f6fd5a37e'),(92366,1942,'sections_0_image','1648'),(92367,1942,'_sections_0_image','field_61d6f6d45a37d'),(92368,1942,'sections_0_heading','Heading'),(92369,1942,'_sections_0_heading','field_61d6f69e5a379'),(92370,1942,'sections_0_subtitle','Ya ya '),(92371,1942,'_sections_0_subtitle','field_61d6f6ac5a37a'),(92372,1942,'sections_0_link_one',''),(92373,1942,'_sections_0_link_one','field_61d6f6b55a37b'),(92374,1942,'sections_0_link_two',''),(92375,1942,'_sections_0_link_two','field_61d6f6c35a37c'),(92376,1942,'sections_1_select_categories','a:1:{i:0;s:2:\"27\";}'),(92377,1942,'_sections_1_select_categories','field_637f04483b63b'),(92378,1942,'intro_head_major','Super Consumers Australia is <span>fighting</span> to ensure that the superannuation industry is <span>held accountable</span> for the outcomes they deliver to Australian consumers.'),(92379,1942,'_intro_head_major','field_64e828783ad9f'),(92380,1942,'intro_head_minor','We want super to work for everyone—not just super fund companies. With our research, journalism and campaigns we are creating the trustworthy and transparent superannuation system we all deserve.'),(92381,1942,'_intro_head_minor','field_64e8288c3ada0'),(92382,1942,'intro_icons_0_int_icon','1922'),(92383,1942,'_intro_icons_0_int_icon','field_64e828b33ada2'),(92384,1942,'intro_icons_0_int_icon_text','At 1,727,000 square kilometres, we’re 2.5 times the size of Texas. <span>Yeeha!</span>'),(92385,1942,'_intro_icons_0_int_icon_text','f