t vel orci. '),(92973,1944,'_report_intro','field_62f30eedb57e2'),(92974,1944,'report_link_url','#'),(92975,1944,'_report_link_url','field_62f30ef4b57e3'),(92976,1944,'report_link_text','Download'),(92977,1944,'_report_link_text','field_62f30f01b57e4'),(92978,1944,'solutions_content','The housing system is complex, and no one solution will solve the complex problems we now face but there are some critical first steps to be taken now.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Set out an ambitious national housing agreement between commonwealth and state governments with targets and funding for the construction of affordable homes.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out tax breaks for property investors and using the increase in revenue to build more public housing.</li>\r\n 	<li>Establish laws which limit rental increases beyond what is fair.</li>\r\n 	<li>Rebalance tenancy laws to provide renters with more security and control, such as eliminating no grounds evictions.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out stamp duty and replace it with a broad-based land tax.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>While there are many opinions on what policy changes will fix the housing market, doing nothing is not an option.</h4>'),(92979,1944,'_solutions_content','field_640e8b307a958'),(92980,1944,'problem_icons_0_prob_icon','1699'),(92981,1944,'_problem_icons_0_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(92982,1944,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','70% highly concerned'),(92983,1944,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(92984,1944,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(92985,1944,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(92986,1944,'problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text',''),(92987,1944,'_problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(92988,1944,'problem_icons','4'),(92989,1944,'_problem_icons','field_640fa0191d518'),(92990,1944,'ceh_content_left',''),(92991,1944,'_ceh_content_left','field_640e97e8f1c8c'),(92992,1944,'ceh_content_right',''),(92993,1944,'_ceh_content_right','field_