</a>\r\n'),(93921,1946,'_sec_2_button','field_5de6e58c86706'),(93922,1946,'sec_3_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/the-project/\">Detailed project description</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"#location\">Location map</a>'),(93923,1946,'_sec_3_button','field_5de6e5a243c03'),(93924,1946,'page_col_image_4','455'),(93925,1946,'_page_col_image_4','field_5de70801090ce'),(93926,1946,'sec_4_title','Location'),(93927,1946,'_sec_4_title','field_5de7082a12a81'),(93928,1946,'sec_4_text','The project will be located in Central NSW about 5km south-west of the small rural township of Coolah. About 120 wind turbines are being proposed across two clusters at Mount Hope and Black Stump.'),(93929,1946,'_sec_4_text','field_5de7084812a82'),(93930,1946,'sec_4_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/about/\">Detailed location information</a>'),(93931,1946,'_sec_4_button','field_5de7085e12a83'),(93932,1946,'news_title','Project updates'),(93933,1946,'_news_title','field_5de78da3aabb9'),(93934,1946,'sec_2_text_copy',''),(93935,1946,'_sec_2_text_copy','field_5de78dc89e613'),(93936,1946,'timeline-title','Timeline'),(93937,1946,'_timeline-title','field_5de78df29e615'),(93938,1946,'timeline_title','Timeline'),(93939,1946,'_timeline_title','field_5de78df29e615'),(93940,1946,'contact_title','Contact us'),(93941,1946,'_contact_title','field_5de7981e06057'),(93942,1946,'contact_intro','Contact text...'),(93943,1946,'_contact_intro','field_5de7983506058'),(93944,1946,'news_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home btn-news\" href=\"/updates/\">See all updates</a>'),(93945,1946,'_news_button','field_5de8329896e02'),(93946,1946,'timeline_intro','Introduction of timeline detail...'),(93947,1946,'_timeline_intro','field_5de98f5fb1781'),(93948,1946,'timeline_pic','477'),(93949,1946,'_timeline_pic','field_5de98f72b1782'),(93950,1946,'timeline_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home btn-news\" href=\"/about/\">Detailed timeline</a>'),(93951,1946,'_timeline_button','field_5de99363677f8')