n revenue to build more public housing.</li>\r\n 	<li>Establish laws which limit rental increases beyond what is fair.</li>\r\n 	<li>Rebalance tenancy laws to provide renters with more security and control, such as eliminating no grounds evictions.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out stamp duty and replace it with a broad-based land tax.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>While there are many opinions on what policy changes will fix the housing market, doing nothing is not an option.</h4>'),(96465,1955,'_solutions_content','field_640e8b307a958'),(96466,1955,'problem_icons_0_prob_icon','1699'),(96467,1955,'_problem_icons_0_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(96468,1955,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','70% highly concerned'),(96469,1955,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(96470,1955,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(96471,1955,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(96472,1955,'problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text',''),(96473,1955,'_problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(96474,1955,'problem_icons','4'),(96475,1955,'_problem_icons','field_640fa0191d518'),(96476,1955,'ceh_content_left',''),(96477,1955,'_ceh_content_left','field_640e97e8f1c8c'),(96478,1955,'ceh_content_right',''),(96479,1955,'_ceh_content_right','field_640e97fdf1c8d'),(96480,1955,'pc_content_left',''),(96481,1955,'_pc_content_left','field_640e983bf1c8f'),(96482,1955,'pc_content_right',''),(96483,1955,'_pc_content_right','field_640e984df1c90'),(96484,1955,'problem_icons_1_prob_icon','1699'),(96485,1955,'_problem_icons_1_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(96486,1955,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','69% highly concerned'),(96487,1955,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(96488,1955,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(96489,1955,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(96490,1955,'problem_icons_1_prob_issue_text',''),(96491,1955,'_problem_icons_1_prob_issue_te