d no one solution will solve the complex problems we now face but there are some critical first steps to be taken now.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Set out an ambitious national housing agreement between commonwealth and state governments with targets and funding for the construction of affordable homes.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out tax breaks for property investors and using the increase in revenue to build more public housing.</li>\r\n 	<li>Establish laws which limit rental increases beyond what is fair.</li>\r\n 	<li>Rebalance tenancy laws to provide renters with more security and control, such as eliminating no grounds evictions.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out stamp duty and replace it with a broad-based land tax.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>While there are many opinions on what policy changes will fix the housing market, doing nothing is not an option.</h4>'),(97160,1957,'_solutions_content','field_640e8b307a958'),(97161,1957,'problem_icons_0_prob_icon','1699'),(97162,1957,'_problem_icons_0_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(97163,1957,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','70% highly concerned'),(97164,1957,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(97165,1957,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(97166,1957,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(97167,1957,'problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text',''),(97168,1957,'_problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(97169,1957,'problem_icons','4'),(97170,1957,'_problem_icons','field_640fa0191d518'),(97171,1957,'ceh_content_left',''),(97172,1957,'_ceh_content_left','field_640e97e8f1c8c'),(97173,1957,'ceh_content_right',''),(97174,1957,'_ceh_content_right','field_640e97fdf1c8d'),(97175,1957,'pc_content_left',''),(97176,1957,'_pc_content_left','field_640e983bf1c8f'),(97177,1957,'pc_content_right',''),(97178,1957,'_pc_content_right','field_640e984df1c90'),(97179,1957,'problem_icons_1_prob_icon','1699'),(97180,1957,'_problem_icons_1_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(97181,1957,'