ned Australians are our about the housing situation.'),(98600,1959,'_problem_signoff','field_641935626adee'),(98601,1959,'sections','a:2:{i:0;s:4:\"hero\";i:1;s:9:\"news_grid\";}'),(98602,1959,'_sections','field_5dafb40b8143a'),(98603,1959,'sections_0_is_full_height','1'),(98604,1959,'_sections_0_is_full_height','field_61d6f6fd5a37e'),(98605,1959,'sections_0_image','1648'),(98606,1959,'_sections_0_image','field_61d6f6d45a37d'),(98607,1959,'sections_0_heading','Heading'),(98608,1959,'_sections_0_heading','field_61d6f69e5a379'),(98609,1959,'sections_0_subtitle','Ya ya '),(98610,1959,'_sections_0_subtitle','field_61d6f6ac5a37a'),(98611,1959,'sections_0_link_one',''),(98612,1959,'_sections_0_link_one','field_61d6f6b55a37b'),(98613,1959,'sections_0_link_two',''),(98614,1959,'_sections_0_link_two','field_61d6f6c35a37c'),(98615,1959,'sections_1_select_categories','a:1:{i:0;s:2:\"27\";}'),(98616,1959,'_sections_1_select_categories','field_637f04483b63b'),(98617,1959,'intro_head_major','Super Consumers Australia is <span>fighting</span> to ensure that the superannuation industry is <span>held accountable</span> for the outcomes they deliver to Australian consumers.'),(98618,1959,'_intro_head_major','field_64e828783ad9f'),(98619,1959,'intro_head_minor','We want super to work for everyone—not just super fund companies. With our research, journalism and campaigns we are creating the trustworthy and transparent superannuation system we all deserve.'),(98620,1959,'_intro_head_minor','field_64e8288c3ada0'),(98621,1959,'intro_icons_0_int_icon','1922'),(98622,1959,'_intro_icons_0_int_icon','field_64e828b33ada2'),(98623,1959,'intro_icons_0_int_icon_text','At 1,727,000 square kilometres, we’re 2.5 times the size of Texas. <span>Yeeha!</span>'),(98624,1959,'_intro_icons_0_int_icon_text','field_64e828e33ada3'),(98625,1959,'intro_icons_1_int_icon','1920'),(98626,1959,'_intro_icons_1_int_icon','field_64e828b33ada2'),(98627,1959,'intro_icons_1_int_icon_text','We have twice as many species 