 by Essential in December 2022, and was completed by 4,735 people.'),(99984,1963,'_monitor_content','field_640fcc4014404'),(99985,1963,'problem_head','Housing in Australia is not working, and Australians are concerned.'),(99986,1963,'_problem_head','field_641935436aded'),(99987,1963,'problem_signoff','Explore the research showing how concerned Australians are our about the housing situation.'),(99988,1963,'_problem_signoff','field_641935626adee'),(99989,1963,'sections','a:2:{i:0;s:4:\"hero\";i:1;s:9:\"news_grid\";}'),(99990,1963,'_sections','field_5dafb40b8143a'),(99991,1963,'sections_0_is_full_height','1'),(99992,1963,'_sections_0_is_full_height','field_61d6f6fd5a37e'),(99993,1963,'sections_0_image','1648'),(99994,1963,'_sections_0_image','field_61d6f6d45a37d'),(99995,1963,'sections_0_heading','Heading'),(99996,1963,'_sections_0_heading','field_61d6f69e5a379'),(99997,1963,'sections_0_subtitle','Ya ya '),(99998,1963,'_sections_0_subtitle','field_61d6f6ac5a37a'),(99999,1963,'sections_0_link_one',''),(100000,1963,'_sections_0_link_one','field_61d6f6b55a37b'),(100001,1963,'sections_0_link_two',''),(100002,1963,'_sections_0_link_two','field_61d6f6c35a37c'),(100003,1963,'sections_1_select_categories','a:1:{i:0;s:2:\"27\";}'),(100004,1963,'_sections_1_select_categories','field_637f04483b63b'),(100005,1963,'intro_head_major','Super Consumers Australia is <span>fighting</span> to ensure that the superannuation industry is <span>held accountable</span> for the outcomes they deliver to Australian consumers.'),(100006,1963,'_intro_head_major','field_64e828783ad9f'),(100007,1963,'intro_head_minor','We want super to work for everyone—not just super fund companies. With our research, journalism and campaigns we are creating the trustworthy and transparent superannuation system we all deserve.'),(100008,1963,'_intro_head_minor','field_64e8288c3ada0'),(100009,1963,'intro_icons_0_int_icon','1922'),(100010,1963,'_intro_icons_0_int_icon','field_64e828b33ada2'),(100011,1963,'intro_icon