rom previous surveys to track trends over time.\r\nThe inaugural poll was conducted by Essential in December 2022, and was completed by 4,735 people.'),(100678,1968,'_monitor_content','field_640fcc4014404'),(100679,1968,'problem_head','Housing in Australia is not working, and Australians are concerned.'),(100680,1968,'_problem_head','field_641935436aded'),(100681,1968,'problem_signoff','Explore the research showing how concerned Australians are our about the housing situation.'),(100682,1968,'_problem_signoff','field_641935626adee'),(100683,1968,'sections','a:2:{i:0;s:4:\"hero\";i:1;s:9:\"news_grid\";}'),(100684,1968,'_sections','field_5dafb40b8143a'),(100685,1968,'sections_0_is_full_height','1'),(100686,1968,'_sections_0_is_full_height','field_61d6f6fd5a37e'),(100687,1968,'sections_0_image','1648'),(100688,1968,'_sections_0_image','field_61d6f6d45a37d'),(100689,1968,'sections_0_heading','Heading'),(100690,1968,'_sections_0_heading','field_61d6f69e5a379'),(100691,1968,'sections_0_subtitle','Ya ya '),(100692,1968,'_sections_0_subtitle','field_61d6f6ac5a37a'),(100693,1968,'sections_0_link_one',''),(100694,1968,'_sections_0_link_one','field_61d6f6b55a37b'),(100695,1968,'sections_0_link_two',''),(100696,1968,'_sections_0_link_two','field_61d6f6c35a37c'),(100697,1968,'sections_1_select_categories','a:1:{i:0;s:2:\"27\";}'),(100698,1968,'_sections_1_select_categories','field_637f04483b63b'),(100699,1968,'intro_head_major','Super Consumers Australia is <span>fighting</span> to ensure that the superannuation industry is <span>held accountable</span> for the outcomes they deliver to Australian consumers.'),(100700,1968,'_intro_head_major','field_64e828783ad9f'),(100701,1968,'intro_head_minor','We want super to work for everyone—not just super fund companies. With our research, journalism and campaigns we are creating the trustworthy and transparent superannuation system we all deserve.'),(100702,1968,'_intro_head_minor','field_64e8288c3ada0'),(100703,1968,'intro_icons_0_int_i