e increase in revenue to build more public housing.</li>\r\n 	<li>Establish laws which limit rental increases beyond what is fair.</li>\r\n 	<li>Rebalance tenancy laws to provide renters with more security and control, such as eliminating no grounds evictions.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out stamp duty and replace it with a broad-based land tax.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>While there are many opinions on what policy changes will fix the housing market, doing nothing is not an option.</h4>'),(101322,1969,'_solutions_content','field_640e8b307a958'),(101323,1969,'problem_icons_0_prob_icon','1699'),(101324,1969,'_problem_icons_0_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(101325,1969,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','70% highly concerned'),(101326,1969,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(101327,1969,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(101328,1969,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(101329,1969,'problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text',''),(101330,1969,'_problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(101331,1969,'problem_icons','4'),(101332,1969,'_problem_icons','field_640fa0191d518'),(101333,1969,'ceh_content_left',''),(101334,1969,'_ceh_content_left','field_640e97e8f1c8c'),(101335,1969,'ceh_content_right',''),(101336,1969,'_ceh_content_right','field_640e97fdf1c8d'),(101337,1969,'pc_content_left',''),(101338,1969,'_pc_content_left','field_640e983bf1c8f'),(101339,1969,'pc_content_right',''),(101340,1969,'_pc_content_right','field_640e984df1c90'),(101341,1969,'problem_icons_1_prob_icon','1699'),(101342,1969,'_problem_icons_1_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(101343,1969,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','69% highly concerned'),(101344,1969,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(101345,1969,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(101346,1969,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(101347,1969,'problem_icons_1_prob_issue_text',''),(1013