there are many opinions on what policy changes will fix the housing market, doing nothing is not an option.</h4>'),(103244,1991,'_solutions_content','field_640e8b307a958'),(103245,1991,'problem_icons_0_prob_icon','1699'),(103246,1991,'_problem_icons_0_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(103247,1991,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','70% highly concerned'),(103248,1991,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(103249,1991,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(103250,1991,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(103251,1991,'problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text',''),(103252,1991,'_problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(103253,1991,'problem_icons','4'),(103254,1991,'_problem_icons','field_640fa0191d518'),(103255,1991,'ceh_content_left',''),(103256,1991,'_ceh_content_left','field_640e97e8f1c8c'),(103257,1991,'ceh_content_right',''),(103258,1991,'_ceh_content_right','field_640e97fdf1c8d'),(103259,1991,'pc_content_left',''),(103260,1991,'_pc_content_left','field_640e983bf1c8f'),(103261,1991,'pc_content_right',''),(103262,1991,'_pc_content_right','field_640e984df1c90'),(103263,1991,'problem_icons_1_prob_icon','1699'),(103264,1991,'_problem_icons_1_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(103265,1991,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','69% highly concerned'),(103266,1991,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(103267,1991,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(103268,1991,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(103269,1991,'problem_icons_1_prob_issue_text',''),(103270,1991,'_problem_icons_1_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(103271,1991,'problem_icons_2_prob_icon','1699'),(103272,1991,'_problem_icons_2_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(103273,1991,'problem_icons_2_prob_concerned_stat','64% highly concerned'),(103274,1991,'_problem_icons_2_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(103275,1991,'problem_icons_2_prob_co