ends and diversity of opinion around the country.\r\n\r\nIt also incorporates questions from previous surveys to track trends over time.\r\nThe inaugural poll was conducted by Essential in December 2022, and was completed by 4,735 people.'),(103296,1991,'_monitor_content','field_640fcc4014404'),(103297,1991,'problem_head','Housing in Australia is not working, and Australians are concerned.'),(103298,1991,'_problem_head','field_641935436aded'),(103299,1991,'problem_signoff','Explore the research showing how concerned Australians are our about the housing situation.'),(103300,1991,'_problem_signoff','field_641935626adee'),(103301,1991,'sections','a:2:{i:0;s:4:\"hero\";i:1;s:9:\"news_grid\";}'),(103302,1991,'_sections','field_5dafb40b8143a'),(103303,1991,'sections_0_is_full_height','1'),(103304,1991,'_sections_0_is_full_height','field_61d6f6fd5a37e'),(103305,1991,'sections_0_image','1648'),(103306,1991,'_sections_0_image','field_61d6f6d45a37d'),(103307,1991,'sections_0_heading','Heading'),(103308,1991,'_sections_0_heading','field_61d6f69e5a379'),(103309,1991,'sections_0_subtitle','Ya ya '),(103310,1991,'_sections_0_subtitle','field_61d6f6ac5a37a'),(103311,1991,'sections_0_link_one',''),(103312,1991,'_sections_0_link_one','field_61d6f6b55a37b'),(103313,1991,'sections_0_link_two',''),(103314,1991,'_sections_0_link_two','field_61d6f6c35a37c'),(103315,1991,'sections_1_select_categories','a:1:{i:0;s:2:\"27\";}'),(103316,1991,'_sections_1_select_categories','field_637f04483b63b'),(103317,1991,'intro_head_major','Super Consumers Australia is <span>fighting</span> to ensure that the superannuation industry is <span>held accountable</span> for the outcomes they deliver to Australian consumers.'),(103318,1991,'_intro_head_major','field_64e828783ad9f'),(103319,1991,'intro_head_minor','We want super to work for everyone—not just super fund companies. With our research, journalism and campaigns we are creating the trustworthy and transparent superannuation system we all deserve.'),