n ambitious national housing agreement between commonwealth and state governments with targets and funding for the construction of affordable homes.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out tax breaks for property investors and using the increase in revenue to build more public housing.</li>\r\n 	<li>Establish laws which limit rental increases beyond what is fair.</li>\r\n 	<li>Rebalance tenancy laws to provide renters with more security and control, such as eliminating no grounds evictions.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out stamp duty and replace it with a broad-based land tax.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>While there are many opinions on what policy changes will fix the housing market, doing nothing is not an option.</h4>'),(105606,2007,'_solutions_content','field_640e8b307a958'),(105607,2007,'problem_icons_0_prob_icon','1699'),(105608,2007,'_problem_icons_0_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(105609,2007,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','70% highly concerned'),(105610,2007,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(105611,2007,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(105612,2007,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(105613,2007,'problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text',''),(105614,2007,'_problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(105615,2007,'problem_icons','4'),(105616,2007,'_problem_icons','field_640fa0191d518'),(105617,2007,'ceh_content_left',''),(105618,2007,'_ceh_content_left','field_640e97e8f1c8c'),(105619,2007,'ceh_content_right',''),(105620,2007,'_ceh_content_right','field_640e97fdf1c8d'),(105621,2007,'pc_content_left',''),(105622,2007,'_pc_content_left','field_640e983bf1c8f'),(105623,2007,'pc_content_right',''),(105624,2007,'_pc_content_right','field_640e984df1c90'),(105625,2007,'problem_icons_1_prob_icon','1699'),(105626,2007,'_problem_icons_1_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(105627,2007,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','69% highly concerned'),(105628,2007,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','field_640