lean/community\">More about the community</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/about/\">Positives for the area</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"#contact\">Contact us</a>\r\n'),(105880,2008,'_sec_2_button','field_5de6e58c86706'),(105881,2008,'sec_3_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/the-project/\">Detailed project description</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"#location\">Location map</a>'),(105882,2008,'_sec_3_button','field_5de6e5a243c03'),(105883,2008,'page_col_image_4','455'),(105884,2008,'_page_col_image_4','field_5de70801090ce'),(105885,2008,'sec_4_title','Location'),(105886,2008,'_sec_4_title','field_5de7082a12a81'),(105887,2008,'sec_4_text','The project will be located in Central NSW about 5km south-west of the small rural township of Coolah. About 120 wind turbines are being proposed across two clusters at Mount Hope and Black Stump.'),(105888,2008,'_sec_4_text','field_5de7084812a82'),(105889,2008,'sec_4_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/about/\">Detailed location information</a>'),(105890,2008,'_sec_4_button','field_5de7085e12a83'),(105891,2008,'news_title','Project updates'),(105892,2008,'_news_title','field_5de78da3aabb9'),(105893,2008,'sec_2_text_copy',''),(105894,2008,'_sec_2_text_copy','field_5de78dc89e613'),(105895,2008,'timeline-title','Timeline'),(105896,2008,'_timeline-title','field_5de78df29e615'),(105897,2008,'timeline_title','Timeline'),(105898,2008,'_timeline_title','field_5de78df29e615'),(105899,2008,'contact_title','Contact us'),(105900,2008,'_contact_title','field_5de7981e06057'),(105901,2008,'contact_intro','Contact text...'),(105902,2008,'_contact_intro','field_5de7983506058'),(105903,2008,'news_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home btn-news\" href=\"/updates/\">See all updates</a>'),(105904,2008,'_news_button','field_5de8329896e02'),(105905,2008,'timeline_intro','Introduction of timeline detail...'),(105906,2008,'_timeline_intro','field_5de98f5fb1781'),(105907,2008,'timeline_pic','477'),(10