provide renters with more security and control, such as eliminating no grounds evictions.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out stamp duty and replace it with a broad-based land tax.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>While there are many opinions on what policy changes will fix the housing market, doing nothing is not an option.</h4>'),(111437,2068,'_solutions_content','field_640e8b307a958'),(111438,2068,'problem_icons_0_prob_icon','1699'),(111439,2068,'_problem_icons_0_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(111440,2068,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','70% highly concerned'),(111441,2068,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(111442,2068,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(111443,2068,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(111444,2068,'problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text',''),(111445,2068,'_problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(111446,2068,'problem_icons','4'),(111447,2068,'_problem_icons','field_640fa0191d518'),(111448,2068,'ceh_content_left',''),(111449,2068,'_ceh_content_left','field_640e97e8f1c8c'),(111450,2068,'ceh_content_right',''),(111451,2068,'_ceh_content_right','field_640e97fdf1c8d'),(111452,2068,'pc_content_left',''),(111453,2068,'_pc_content_left','field_640e983bf1c8f'),(111454,2068,'pc_content_right',''),(111455,2068,'_pc_content_right','field_640e984df1c90'),(111456,2068,'problem_icons_1_prob_icon','1699'),(111457,2068,'_problem_icons_1_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(111458,2068,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','69% highly concerned'),(111459,2068,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(111460,2068,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(111461,2068,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(111462,2068,'problem_icons_1_prob_issue_text',''),(111463,2068,'_problem_icons_1_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(111464,2068,'problem_icons_2_prob_icon','1699'),(111465,2068,'_problem_icons_2_prob_icon','field_640fa02