d funding for the construction of affordable homes.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out tax breaks for property investors and using the increase in revenue to build more public housing.</li>\r\n 	<li>Establish laws which limit rental increases beyond what is fair.</li>\r\n 	<li>Rebalance tenancy laws to provide renters with more security and control, such as eliminating no grounds evictions.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out stamp duty and replace it with a broad-based land tax.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>While there are many opinions on what policy changes will fix the housing market, doing nothing is not an option.</h4>'),(112133,2069,'_solutions_content','field_640e8b307a958'),(112134,2069,'problem_icons_0_prob_icon','1699'),(112135,2069,'_problem_icons_0_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(112136,2069,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','70% highly concerned'),(112137,2069,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(112138,2069,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(112139,2069,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(112140,2069,'problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text',''),(112141,2069,'_problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(112142,2069,'problem_icons','4'),(112143,2069,'_problem_icons','field_640fa0191d518'),(112144,2069,'ceh_content_left',''),(112145,2069,'_ceh_content_left','field_640e97e8f1c8c'),(112146,2069,'ceh_content_right',''),(112147,2069,'_ceh_content_right','field_640e97fdf1c8d'),(112148,2069,'pc_content_left',''),(112149,2069,'_pc_content_left','field_640e983bf1c8f'),(112150,2069,'pc_content_right',''),(112151,2069,'_pc_content_right','field_640e984df1c90'),(112152,2069,'problem_icons_1_prob_icon','1699'),(112153,2069,'_problem_icons_1_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(112154,2069,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','69% highly concerned'),(112155,2069,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(112156,2069,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(112157,2