 will be capable of generating 2,000,000 megawatt hours of clean renewable energy each year.'),(113883,2102,'_sec_3_text','field_5de6e4044e5e8'),(113884,2102,'page_col_image_2','436'),(113885,2102,'_page_col_image_2','field_5de6546e7c63a'),(113886,2102,'sec_2_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/community\">More about the community</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/about/\">Positives for the area</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"#contact\">Contact us</a>\r\n'),(113887,2102,'_sec_2_button','field_5de6e58c86706'),(113888,2102,'sec_3_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/the-project/\">Detailed project description</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"#location\">Location map</a>'),(113889,2102,'_sec_3_button','field_5de6e5a243c03'),(113890,2102,'page_col_image_4','455'),(113891,2102,'_page_col_image_4','field_5de70801090ce'),(113892,2102,'sec_4_title','Location'),(113893,2102,'_sec_4_title','field_5de7082a12a81'),(113894,2102,'sec_4_text','The project will be located in Central NSW about 5km south-west of the small rural township of Coolah. About 120 wind turbines are being proposed across two clusters at Mount Hope and Black Stump.'),(113895,2102,'_sec_4_text','field_5de7084812a82'),(113896,2102,'sec_4_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/about/\">Detailed location information</a>'),(113897,2102,'_sec_4_button','field_5de7085e12a83'),(113898,2102,'news_title','Project updates'),(113899,2102,'_news_title','field_5de78da3aabb9'),(113900,2102,'sec_2_text_copy',''),(113901,2102,'_sec_2_text_copy','field_5de78dc89e613'),(113902,2102,'timeline-title','Timeline'),(113903,2102,'_timeline-title','field_5de78df29e615'),(113904,2102,'timeline_title','Timeline'),(113905,2102,'_timeline_title','field_5de78df29e615'),(113906,2102,'contact_title','Contact us'),(113907,2102,'_contact_title','field_5de7981e06057'),(113908,2102,'contact_intro','Contact text...'),(113909,2102,'_contact_intro','field_5de7983506058'),(113910