,'The housing system is complex, and no one solution will solve the complex problems we now face but there are some critical first steps to be taken now.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Set out an ambitious national housing agreement between commonwealth and state governments with targets and funding for the construction of affordable homes.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out tax breaks for property investors and using the increase in revenue to build more public housing.</li>\r\n 	<li>Establish laws which limit rental increases beyond what is fair.</li>\r\n 	<li>Rebalance tenancy laws to provide renters with more security and control, such as eliminating no grounds evictions.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out stamp duty and replace it with a broad-based land tax.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>While there are many opinions on what policy changes will fix the housing market, doing nothing is not an option.</h4>'),(115032,2122,'_solutions_content','field_640e8b307a958'),(115033,2122,'problem_icons_0_prob_icon','1699'),(115034,2122,'_problem_icons_0_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(115035,2122,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','70% highly concerned'),(115036,2122,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(115037,2122,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(115038,2122,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(115039,2122,'problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text',''),(115040,2122,'_problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(115041,2122,'problem_icons','4'),(115042,2122,'_problem_icons','field_640fa0191d518'),(115043,2122,'ceh_content_left',''),(115044,2122,'_ceh_content_left','field_640e97e8f1c8c'),(115045,2122,'ceh_content_right',''),(115046,2122,'_ceh_content_right','field_640e97fdf1c8d'),(115047,2122,'pc_content_left',''),(115048,2122,'_pc_content_left','field_640e983bf1c8f'),(115049,2122,'pc_content_right',''),(115050,2122,'_pc_content_right','field_640e984df1c90'),(115051,2122,'problem_icons_1_prob_icon','1699'),(115052,2122,'_problem