n what policy changes will fix the housing market, doing nothing is not an option.</h4>'),(118026,2126,'_solutions_content','field_640e8b307a958'),(118027,2126,'problem_icons_0_prob_icon','1699'),(118028,2126,'_problem_icons_0_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(118029,2126,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','70% highly concerned'),(118030,2126,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(118031,2126,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(118032,2126,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(118033,2126,'problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text',''),(118034,2126,'_problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(118035,2126,'problem_icons','4'),(118036,2126,'_problem_icons','field_640fa0191d518'),(118037,2126,'ceh_content_left',''),(118038,2126,'_ceh_content_left','field_640e97e8f1c8c'),(118039,2126,'ceh_content_right',''),(118040,2126,'_ceh_content_right','field_640e97fdf1c8d'),(118041,2126,'pc_content_left',''),(118042,2126,'_pc_content_left','field_640e983bf1c8f'),(118043,2126,'pc_content_right',''),(118044,2126,'_pc_content_right','field_640e984df1c90'),(118045,2126,'problem_icons_1_prob_icon','1699'),(118046,2126,'_problem_icons_1_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(118047,2126,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','69% highly concerned'),(118048,2126,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(118049,2126,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(118050,2126,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(118051,2126,'problem_icons_1_prob_issue_text',''),(118052,2126,'_problem_icons_1_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(118053,2126,'problem_icons_2_prob_icon','1699'),(118054,2126,'_problem_icons_2_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(118055,2126,'problem_icons_2_prob_concerned_stat','64% highly concerned'),(118056,2126,'_problem_icons_2_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(118057,2126,'problem_icons_2_prob_concerded_text','are highly