nion around the country.\r\n\r\nIt also incorporates questions from previous surveys to track trends over time.\r\nThe inaugural poll was conducted by Essential in December 2022, and was completed by 4,735 people.'),(118078,2126,'_monitor_content','field_640fcc4014404'),(118079,2126,'problem_head','Housing in Australia is not working, and Australians are concerned.'),(118080,2126,'_problem_head','field_641935436aded'),(118081,2126,'problem_signoff','Explore the research showing how concerned Australians are our about the housing situation.'),(118082,2126,'_problem_signoff','field_641935626adee'),(118083,2126,'sections','a:2:{i:0;s:4:\"hero\";i:1;s:9:\"news_grid\";}'),(118084,2126,'_sections','field_5dafb40b8143a'),(118085,2126,'sections_0_is_full_height','1'),(118086,2126,'_sections_0_is_full_height','field_61d6f6fd5a37e'),(118087,2126,'sections_0_image','1648'),(118088,2126,'_sections_0_image','field_61d6f6d45a37d'),(118089,2126,'sections_0_heading','Heading'),(118090,2126,'_sections_0_heading','field_61d6f69e5a379'),(118091,2126,'sections_0_subtitle','Ya ya '),(118092,2126,'_sections_0_subtitle','field_61d6f6ac5a37a'),(118093,2126,'sections_0_link_one',''),(118094,2126,'_sections_0_link_one','field_61d6f6b55a37b'),(118095,2126,'sections_0_link_two',''),(118096,2126,'_sections_0_link_two','field_61d6f6c35a37c'),(118097,2126,'sections_1_select_categories','a:1:{i:0;s:2:\"27\";}'),(118098,2126,'_sections_1_select_categories','field_637f04483b63b'),(118099,2126,'intro_head_major','Super Consumers Australia is <span>fighting</span> to ensure that the superannuation industry is <span>held accountable</span> for the outcomes they deliver to Australian consumers.'),(118100,2126,'_intro_head_major','field_64e828783ad9f'),(118101,2126,'intro_head_minor','We want super to work for everyone—not just super fund companies. With our research, journalism and campaigns we are creating the trustworthy and transparent superannuation system we all deserve.'),(118102,2126,'_intro_head