 solve the complex problems we now face but there are some critical first steps to be taken now.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Set out an ambitious national housing agreement between commonwealth and state governments with targets and funding for the construction of affordable homes.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out tax breaks for property investors and using the increase in revenue to build more public housing.</li>\r\n 	<li>Establish laws which limit rental increases beyond what is fair.</li>\r\n 	<li>Rebalance tenancy laws to provide renters with more security and control, such as eliminating no grounds evictions.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out stamp duty and replace it with a broad-based land tax.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>While there are many opinions on what policy changes will fix the housing market, doing nothing is not an option.</h4>'),(118866,2156,'_solutions_content','field_640e8b307a958'),(118867,2156,'problem_icons_0_prob_icon','1699'),(118868,2156,'_problem_icons_0_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(118869,2156,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','70% highly concerned'),(118870,2156,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(118871,2156,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(118872,2156,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(118873,2156,'problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text',''),(118874,2156,'_problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(118875,2156,'problem_icons','4'),(118876,2156,'_problem_icons','field_640fa0191d518'),(118877,2156,'ceh_content_left',''),(118878,2156,'_ceh_content_left','field_640e97e8f1c8c'),(118879,2156,'ceh_content_right',''),(118880,2156,'_ceh_content_right','field_640e97fdf1c8d'),(118881,2156,'pc_content_left',''),(118882,2156,'_pc_content_left','field_640e983bf1c8f'),(118883,2156,'pc_content_right',''),(118884,2156,'_pc_content_right','field_640e984df1c90'),(118885,2156,'problem_icons_1_prob_icon','1699'),(118886,2156,'_problem_icons_1_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(118887,2156,'