\n\r\nIt also incorporates questions from previous surveys to track trends over time.\r\nThe inaugural poll was conducted by Essential in December 2022, and was completed by 4,735 people.'),(119617,2158,'_monitor_content','field_640fcc4014404'),(119618,2158,'problem_head','Housing in Australia is not working, and Australians are concerned.'),(119619,2158,'_problem_head','field_641935436aded'),(119620,2158,'problem_signoff','Explore the research showing how concerned Australians are our about the housing situation.'),(119621,2158,'_problem_signoff','field_641935626adee'),(119622,2158,'sections','a:2:{i:0;s:4:\"hero\";i:1;s:9:\"news_grid\";}'),(119623,2158,'_sections','field_5dafb40b8143a'),(119624,2158,'sections_0_is_full_height','1'),(119625,2158,'_sections_0_is_full_height','field_61d6f6fd5a37e'),(119626,2158,'sections_0_image','1648'),(119627,2158,'_sections_0_image','field_61d6f6d45a37d'),(119628,2158,'sections_0_heading','Heading'),(119629,2158,'_sections_0_heading','field_61d6f69e5a379'),(119630,2158,'sections_0_subtitle','Ya ya '),(119631,2158,'_sections_0_subtitle','field_61d6f6ac5a37a'),(119632,2158,'sections_0_link_one',''),(119633,2158,'_sections_0_link_one','field_61d6f6b55a37b'),(119634,2158,'sections_0_link_two',''),(119635,2158,'_sections_0_link_two','field_61d6f6c35a37c'),(119636,2158,'sections_1_select_categories','a:1:{i:0;s:2:\"27\";}'),(119637,2158,'_sections_1_select_categories','field_637f04483b63b'),(119638,2158,'intro_head_major','Super Consumers Australia is <span>fighting</span> to ensure that the superannuation industry is <span>held accountable</span> for the outcomes they deliver to Australian consumers.'),(119639,2158,'_intro_head_major','field_64e828783ad9f'),(119640,2158,'intro_head_minor','We want super to work for everyone—not just super fund companies. With our research, journalism and campaigns we are creating the trustworthy and transparent superannuation system we all deserve.'),(119641,2158,'_intro_head_minor','field_64e8288c3ada0'),(119642,2158,'intro_icons_0_int_icon','1922'),(119643,2158,'_intro_icons_0_int_icon','field_64e828b33ada2'),(119644,2158,'intro_icons_0_int_icon_text','At 1,727,000 square kilometres, we’re 2.5 times the size of Texas. <span>Yeeha!</span>'),(119645,2158,'_intro_icons_0_int_icon_text','field_64e828e33ada3'),(119646,2158,'intro_icons_1_int_icon','1920'),(119647,2158,'_intro_icons_1_int_icon','field_64e828b33ada2'),(119648,2158,'intro_icons_1_int_icon_text','We have twice as many species of native plant and animal as any other Australian state or territory.'),(119649,2158,'_intro_icons_1_int_icon_text','field_64e828e33ada3'),(119650,2158,'intro_icons_2_int_icon','1921'),(119651,2158,'_intro_icons_2_int_icon','field_64e828b33ada2'),(119652,2158,'intro_icons_2_int_icon_text','We have less land classified as ‘protected’ than any other state or territory.'),(119653,2158,'_intro_icons_2_int_icon_text','field_64e828e33ada3'),(119654,2158,'intro_icons','3'),(119655,2158,'_intro_icons','field_64e828963ada1'),(119656,2158,'threat_head_major','What we stand to lose if we don’t act soon to protect beautiful Queensland:'),(119657,2158,'_threat_head_major','field_64ec258d9dbd1'),(119658,2158,'threats_icons','3'),(119659,2158,'_threats_icons','field_64ec2551a93f9'),(119660,2158,'threats_icons_0_thr_icon','1819'),(119661,2158,'_threats_icons_0_thr_icon','field_64ec2551a93fa'),(119662,2158,'threats_icons_0_thr_icon_text','The rich cultural heritage of our First Nations people and their continuous ties to country, dating back more than 50,000 years.'),(119663,2158,'_threats_icons_0_thr_icon_text','field_64ec2551a93fb'),(119664,2158,'threats_icons_1_thr_icon','1819'),(119665,2158,'_threats_icons_1_thr_icon','field_64ec2551a93fa'),(119666,2158,'threats_icons_1_thr_icon_text','Thousands of species of plant and animal which are now classified as threatened or endangered in Queensland.'),(119667,2158,'_threats_icons_1_thr_icon_text','field_64ec2551a93fb'),(119668,2158,'threats_icons_2_