o build more public housing.</li>\r\n 	<li>Establish laws which limit rental increases beyond what is fair.</li>\r\n 	<li>Rebalance tenancy laws to provide renters with more security and control, such as eliminating no grounds evictions.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out stamp duty and replace it with a broad-based land tax.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>While there are many opinions on what policy changes will fix the housing market, doing nothing is not an option.</h4>'),(120268,2159,'_solutions_content','field_640e8b307a958'),(120269,2159,'problem_icons_0_prob_icon','1699'),(120270,2159,'_problem_icons_0_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(120271,2159,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','70% highly concerned'),(120272,2159,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(120273,2159,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(120274,2159,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(120275,2159,'problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text',''),(120276,2159,'_problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(120277,2159,'problem_icons','4'),(120278,2159,'_problem_icons','field_640fa0191d518'),(120279,2159,'ceh_content_left',''),(120280,2159,'_ceh_content_left','field_640e97e8f1c8c'),(120281,2159,'ceh_content_right',''),(120282,2159,'_ceh_content_right','field_640e97fdf1c8d'),(120283,2159,'pc_content_left',''),(120284,2159,'_pc_content_left','field_640e983bf1c8f'),(120285,2159,'pc_content_right',''),(120286,2159,'_pc_content_right','field_640e984df1c90'),(120287,2159,'problem_icons_1_prob_icon','1699'),(120288,2159,'_problem_icons_1_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(120289,2159,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','69% highly concerned'),(120290,2159,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(120291,2159,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(120292,2159,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(120293,2159,'problem_icons_1_prob_issue_text',''),(120294,2159,'_problem_icons