the increase in revenue to build more public housing.</li>\r\n 	<li>Establish laws which limit rental increases beyond what is fair.</li>\r\n 	<li>Rebalance tenancy laws to provide renters with more security and control, such as eliminating no grounds evictions.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out stamp duty and replace it with a broad-based land tax.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>While there are many opinions on what policy changes will fix the housing market, doing nothing is not an option.</h4>'),(120965,2160,'_solutions_content','field_640e8b307a958'),(120966,2160,'problem_icons_0_prob_icon','1699'),(120967,2160,'_problem_icons_0_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(120968,2160,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','70% highly concerned'),(120969,2160,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(120970,2160,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(120971,2160,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(120972,2160,'problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text',''),(120973,2160,'_problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(120974,2160,'problem_icons','4'),(120975,2160,'_problem_icons','field_640fa0191d518'),(120976,2160,'ceh_content_left',''),(120977,2160,'_ceh_content_left','field_640e97e8f1c8c'),(120978,2160,'ceh_content_right',''),(120979,2160,'_ceh_content_right','field_640e97fdf1c8d'),(120980,2160,'pc_content_left',''),(120981,2160,'_pc_content_left','field_640e983bf1c8f'),(120982,2160,'pc_content_right',''),(120983,2160,'_pc_content_right','field_640e984df1c90'),(120984,2160,'problem_icons_1_prob_icon','1699'),(120985,2160,'_problem_icons_1_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(120986,2160,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','69% highly concerned'),(120987,2160,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(120988,2160,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(120989,2160,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(120990,2160,'problem_icons_1_prob_issue_text',''),(12