67\";i:2;s:4:\"2089\";}'),(122624,2163,'_report_questions','field_6109ed5e02e5a'),(122625,2163,'intro_text','The Disability Dialogue is a place where people with disabilities, their families, organisations providing support, academics, and the wider community come together to work on things that matter to us.\r\n\r\nThe Dialogue is a hub of knowledge and collaboration, separate from government, where we work together to come up. With new ideas on important topics. Our ideas can make a big difference in how services and systems are set up for people with disabilities.'),(122626,2163,'_intro_text','field_66441acfe963c'),(122629,2164,'footnotes',''),(122631,2164,'banner_head',''),(122632,2164,'_banner_head','field_5b568121a8ffe'),(122633,2164,'banner_sub',''),(122634,2164,'_banner_sub','field_5b568139fd366'),(122635,2164,'banner_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" style=\"width: 200px;\" href=\"#project\">Sign the petition</a>'),(122636,2164,'_banner_button','field_5b568147fd367'),(122637,2164,'support_section_title','How can Lifestart support you?'),(122638,2164,'_support_section_title','field_5b67c7d060398'),(122639,2164,'support_left_title','Services'),(122640,2164,'_support_left_title','field_5b67c298e7f8f'),(122641,2164,'support_left_cont','Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetuer adipiscing elit, sed diam nonummy.'),(122642,2164,'_support_left_cont','field_5b67c5f6e7f91'),(122643,2164,'support_left_button','<a class=\"btn btn-green\" href=\"/services/\">View all services</a>'),(122644,2164,'_support_left_button','field_5b67c60ae7f92'),(122645,2164,'support_ctr_title','Talk to us'),(122646,2164,'_support_ctr_title','field_5b67c62a58af3'),(122647,2164,'support_ctr_cont','Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetuer adipiscing elit, sed diam nonummy nibh euismod tincidunt ut laoreet.'),(122648,2164,'_support_ctr_cont','field_5b67c63158af4'),(122649,2164,'support_ctr_button','<a class=\"btn btn-orange\" href=\"/supports/\">Find us</a>'),(122650,2164,'_support_ctr_button',