king, and Australians are concerned.'),(123162,2164,'_problem_head','field_641935436aded'),(123163,2164,'problem_signoff','Explore the research showing how concerned Australians are our about the housing situation.'),(123164,2164,'_problem_signoff','field_641935626adee'),(123165,2164,'sections','a:2:{i:0;s:4:\"hero\";i:1;s:9:\"news_grid\";}'),(123166,2164,'_sections','field_5dafb40b8143a'),(123167,2164,'sections_0_is_full_height','1'),(123168,2164,'_sections_0_is_full_height','field_61d6f6fd5a37e'),(123169,2164,'sections_0_image','1648'),(123170,2164,'_sections_0_image','field_61d6f6d45a37d'),(123171,2164,'sections_0_heading','Heading'),(123172,2164,'_sections_0_heading','field_61d6f69e5a379'),(123173,2164,'sections_0_subtitle','Ya ya '),(123174,2164,'_sections_0_subtitle','field_61d6f6ac5a37a'),(123175,2164,'sections_0_link_one',''),(123176,2164,'_sections_0_link_one','field_61d6f6b55a37b'),(123177,2164,'sections_0_link_two',''),(123178,2164,'_sections_0_link_two','field_61d6f6c35a37c'),(123179,2164,'sections_1_select_categories','a:1:{i:0;s:2:\"27\";}'),(123180,2164,'_sections_1_select_categories','field_637f04483b63b'),(123181,2164,'intro_head_major','Welcome to the Disability Dialogue'),(123182,2164,'_intro_head_major','field_64e828783ad9f'),(123183,2164,'intro_head_minor',''),(123184,2164,'_intro_head_minor','field_64e8288c3ada0'),(123185,2164,'intro_icons_0_int_icon','1922'),(123186,2164,'_intro_icons_0_int_icon','field_64e828b33ada2'),(123187,2164,'intro_icons_0_int_icon_text','At 1,727,000 square kilometres, we’re 2.5 times the size of Texas. <span>Yeeha!</span>'),(123188,2164,'_intro_icons_0_int_icon_text','field_64e828e33ada3'),(123189,2164,'intro_icons_1_int_icon','1920'),(123190,2164,'_intro_icons_1_int_icon','field_64e828b33ada2'),(123191,2164,'intro_icons_1_int_icon_text','We have twice as many species of native plant and animal as any other Australian state or territory.'),(123192,2164,'_intro_icons_1_int_icon_text','field_64e828e33ada3'),(123193,2164