minating no grounds evictions.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out stamp duty and replace it with a broad-based land tax.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>While there are many opinions on what policy changes will fix the housing market, doing nothing is not an option.</h4>'),(125229,2177,'_solutions_content','field_640e8b307a958'),(125230,2177,'problem_icons_0_prob_icon','1699'),(125231,2177,'_problem_icons_0_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(125232,2177,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','70% highly concerned'),(125233,2177,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(125234,2177,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(125235,2177,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(125236,2177,'problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text',''),(125237,2177,'_problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(125238,2177,'problem_icons','4'),(125239,2177,'_problem_icons','field_640fa0191d518'),(125240,2177,'ceh_content_left',''),(125241,2177,'_ceh_content_left','field_640e97e8f1c8c'),(125242,2177,'ceh_content_right',''),(125243,2177,'_ceh_content_right','field_640e97fdf1c8d'),(125244,2177,'pc_content_left',''),(125245,2177,'_pc_content_left','field_640e983bf1c8f'),(125246,2177,'pc_content_right',''),(125247,2177,'_pc_content_right','field_640e984df1c90'),(125248,2177,'problem_icons_1_prob_icon','1699'),(125249,2177,'_problem_icons_1_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(125250,2177,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','69% highly concerned'),(125251,2177,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(125252,2177,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(125253,2177,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(125254,2177,'problem_icons_1_prob_issue_text',''),(125255,2177,'_problem_icons_1_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(125256,2177,'problem_icons_2_prob_icon','1699'),(125257,2177,'_problem_icons_2_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(125258,2177,'problem_icons_2_prob_concerned_stat'