ember 2022, and was completed by 4,735 people.'),(126117,2201,'_monitor_content','field_640fcc4014404'),(126118,2201,'problem_head','Housing in Australia is not working, and Australians are concerned.'),(126119,2201,'_problem_head','field_641935436aded'),(126120,2201,'problem_signoff','Explore the research showing how concerned Australians are our about the housing situation.'),(126121,2201,'_problem_signoff','field_641935626adee'),(126122,2201,'sections','a:2:{i:0;s:4:\"hero\";i:1;s:9:\"news_grid\";}'),(126123,2201,'_sections','field_5dafb40b8143a'),(126124,2201,'sections_0_is_full_height','1'),(126125,2201,'_sections_0_is_full_height','field_61d6f6fd5a37e'),(126126,2201,'sections_0_image','1648'),(126127,2201,'_sections_0_image','field_61d6f6d45a37d'),(126128,2201,'sections_0_heading','Heading'),(126129,2201,'_sections_0_heading','field_61d6f69e5a379'),(126130,2201,'sections_0_subtitle','Ya ya '),(126131,2201,'_sections_0_subtitle','field_61d6f6ac5a37a'),(126132,2201,'sections_0_link_one',''),(126133,2201,'_sections_0_link_one','field_61d6f6b55a37b'),(126134,2201,'sections_0_link_two',''),(126135,2201,'_sections_0_link_two','field_61d6f6c35a37c'),(126136,2201,'sections_1_select_categories','a:1:{i:0;s:2:\"27\";}'),(126137,2201,'_sections_1_select_categories','field_637f04483b63b'),(126138,2201,'intro_head_major','Welcome to the Disability Dialogue'),(126139,2201,'_intro_head_major','field_64e828783ad9f'),(126140,2201,'intro_head_minor',''),(126141,2201,'_intro_head_minor','field_64e8288c3ada0'),(126142,2201,'intro_icons_0_int_icon','1922'),(126143,2201,'_intro_icons_0_int_icon','field_64e828b33ada2'),(126144,2201,'intro_icons_0_int_icon_text','At 1,727,000 square kilometres, we’re 2.5 times the size of Texas. <span>Yeeha!</span>'),(126145,2201,'_intro_icons_0_int_icon_text','field_64e828e33ada3'),(126146,2201,'intro_icons_1_int_icon','1920'),(126147,2201,'_intro_icons_1_int_icon','field_64e828b33ada2'),(126148,2201,'intro_icons_1_int_icon_text','We have twice as m