rounds evictions.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out stamp duty and replace it with a broad-based land tax.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>While there are many opinions on what policy changes will fix the housing market, doing nothing is not an option.</h4>'),(126771,2202,'_solutions_content','field_640e8b307a958'),(126772,2202,'problem_icons_0_prob_icon','1699'),(126773,2202,'_problem_icons_0_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(126774,2202,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','70% highly concerned'),(126775,2202,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(126776,2202,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(126777,2202,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(126778,2202,'problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text',''),(126779,2202,'_problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(126780,2202,'problem_icons','4'),(126781,2202,'_problem_icons','field_640fa0191d518'),(126782,2202,'ceh_content_left',''),(126783,2202,'_ceh_content_left','field_640e97e8f1c8c'),(126784,2202,'ceh_content_right',''),(126785,2202,'_ceh_content_right','field_640e97fdf1c8d'),(126786,2202,'pc_content_left',''),(126787,2202,'_pc_content_left','field_640e983bf1c8f'),(126788,2202,'pc_content_right',''),(126789,2202,'_pc_content_right','field_640e984df1c90'),(126790,2202,'problem_icons_1_prob_icon','1699'),(126791,2202,'_problem_icons_1_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(126792,2202,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','69% highly concerned'),(126793,2202,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(126794,2202,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(126795,2202,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(126796,2202,'problem_icons_1_prob_issue_text',''),(126797,2202,'_problem_icons_1_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(126798,2202,'problem_icons_2_prob_icon','1699'),(126799,2202,'_problem_icons_2_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(126800,2202,'problem_icons_2_prob_concerned_stat','64% highly 