uction of affordable homes.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out tax breaks for property investors and using the increase in revenue to build more public housing.</li>\r\n 	<li>Establish laws which limit rental increases beyond what is fair.</li>\r\n 	<li>Rebalance tenancy laws to provide renters with more security and control, such as eliminating no grounds evictions.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out stamp duty and replace it with a broad-based land tax.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>While there are many opinions on what policy changes will fix the housing market, doing nothing is not an option.</h4>'),(127477,2203,'_solutions_content','field_640e8b307a958'),(127478,2203,'problem_icons_0_prob_icon','1699'),(127479,2203,'_problem_icons_0_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(127480,2203,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','70% highly concerned'),(127481,2203,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(127482,2203,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(127483,2203,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(127484,2203,'problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text',''),(127485,2203,'_problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(127486,2203,'problem_icons','4'),(127487,2203,'_problem_icons','field_640fa0191d518'),(127488,2203,'ceh_content_left',''),(127489,2203,'_ceh_content_left','field_640e97e8f1c8c'),(127490,2203,'ceh_content_right',''),(127491,2203,'_ceh_content_right','field_640e97fdf1c8d'),(127492,2203,'pc_content_left',''),(127493,2203,'_pc_content_left','field_640e983bf1c8f'),(127494,2203,'pc_content_right',''),(127495,2203,'_pc_content_right','field_640e984df1c90'),(127496,2203,'problem_icons_1_prob_icon','1699'),(127497,2203,'_problem_icons_1_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(127498,2203,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','69% highly concerned'),(127499,2203,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(127500,2203,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(127501,2203,'_problem_icons_1_pr