hyveclean/community\">More about the community</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/about/\">Positives for the area</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"#contact\">Contact us</a>\r\n'),(130254,2243,'_sec_2_button','field_5de6e58c86706'),(130255,2243,'sec_3_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/the-project/\">Detailed project description</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"#location\">Location map</a>'),(130256,2243,'_sec_3_button','field_5de6e5a243c03'),(130257,2243,'page_col_image_4','455'),(130258,2243,'_page_col_image_4','field_5de70801090ce'),(130259,2243,'sec_4_title','Location'),(130260,2243,'_sec_4_title','field_5de7082a12a81'),(130261,2243,'sec_4_text','The project will be located in Central NSW about 5km south-west of the small rural township of Coolah. About 120 wind turbines are being proposed across two clusters at Mount Hope and Black Stump.'),(130262,2243,'_sec_4_text','field_5de7084812a82'),(130263,2243,'sec_4_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/about/\">Detailed location information</a>'),(130264,2243,'_sec_4_button','field_5de7085e12a83'),(130265,2243,'news_title','Project updates'),(130266,2243,'_news_title','field_5de78da3aabb9'),(130267,2243,'sec_2_text_copy',''),(130268,2243,'_sec_2_text_copy','field_5de78dc89e613'),(130269,2243,'timeline-title','Timeline'),(130270,2243,'_timeline-title','field_5de78df29e615'),(130271,2243,'timeline_title','Timeline'),(130272,2243,'_timeline_title','field_5de78df29e615'),(130273,2243,'contact_title','Contact us'),(130274,2243,'_contact_title','field_5de7981e06057'),(130275,2243,'contact_intro','Contact text...'),(130276,2243,'_contact_intro','field_5de7983506058'),(130277,2243,'news_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home btn-news\" href=\"/updates/\">See all updates</a>'),(130278,2243,'_news_button','field_5de8329896e02'),(130279,2243,'timeline_intro','Introduction of timeline detail...'),(130280,2243,'_timeline_intro','field_5de98f5fb1781'),(130281,2243,'timeline_pic','477'