to be taken now.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Set out an ambitious national housing agreement between commonwealth and state governments with targets and funding for the construction of affordable homes.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out tax breaks for property investors and using the increase in revenue to build more public housing.</li>\r\n 	<li>Establish laws which limit rental increases beyond what is fair.</li>\r\n 	<li>Rebalance tenancy laws to provide renters with more security and control, such as eliminating no grounds evictions.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out stamp duty and replace it with a broad-based land tax.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>While there are many opinions on what policy changes will fix the housing market, doing nothing is not an option.</h4>'),(132106,2246,'_solutions_content','field_640e8b307a958'),(132107,2246,'problem_icons_0_prob_icon','1699'),(132108,2246,'_problem_icons_0_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(132109,2246,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','70% highly concerned'),(132110,2246,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(132111,2246,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(132112,2246,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(132113,2246,'problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text',''),(132114,2246,'_problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(132115,2246,'problem_icons','4'),(132116,2246,'_problem_icons','field_640fa0191d518'),(132117,2246,'ceh_content_left',''),(132118,2246,'_ceh_content_left','field_640e97e8f1c8c'),(132119,2246,'ceh_content_right',''),(132120,2246,'_ceh_content_right','field_640e97fdf1c8d'),(132121,2246,'pc_content_left',''),(132122,2246,'_pc_content_left','field_640e983bf1c8f'),(132123,2246,'pc_content_right',''),(132124,2246,'_pc_content_right','field_640e984df1c90'),(132125,2246,'problem_icons_1_prob_icon','1699'),(132126,2246,'_problem_icons_1_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(132127,2246,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','69% highly concerned'),(132128,2246,'_prob