 and using the increase in revenue to build more public housing.</li>\r\n 	<li>Establish laws which limit rental increases beyond what is fair.</li>\r\n 	<li>Rebalance tenancy laws to provide renters with more security and control, such as eliminating no grounds evictions.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out stamp duty and replace it with a broad-based land tax.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>While there are many opinions on what policy changes will fix the housing market, doing nothing is not an option.</h4>'),(132829,2250,'_solutions_content','field_640e8b307a958'),(132830,2250,'problem_icons_0_prob_icon','1699'),(132831,2250,'_problem_icons_0_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(132832,2250,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','70% highly concerned'),(132833,2250,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(132834,2250,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(132835,2250,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(132836,2250,'problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text',''),(132837,2250,'_problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(132838,2250,'problem_icons','4'),(132839,2250,'_problem_icons','field_640fa0191d518'),(132840,2250,'ceh_content_left',''),(132841,2250,'_ceh_content_left','field_640e97e8f1c8c'),(132842,2250,'ceh_content_right',''),(132843,2250,'_ceh_content_right','field_640e97fdf1c8d'),(132844,2250,'pc_content_left',''),(132845,2250,'_pc_content_left','field_640e983bf1c8f'),(132846,2250,'pc_content_right',''),(132847,2250,'_pc_content_right','field_640e984df1c90'),(132848,2250,'problem_icons_1_prob_icon','1699'),(132849,2250,'_problem_icons_1_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(132850,2250,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','69% highly concerned'),(132851,2250,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(132852,2250,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(132853,2250,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(132854,2250,'problem_icons_1_prob_issue_te