 for property investors and using the increase in revenue to build more public housing.</li>\r\n 	<li>Establish laws which limit rental increases beyond what is fair.</li>\r\n 	<li>Rebalance tenancy laws to provide renters with more security and control, such as eliminating no grounds evictions.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out stamp duty and replace it with a broad-based land tax.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>While there are many opinions on what policy changes will fix the housing market, doing nothing is not an option.</h4>'),(133553,2252,'_solutions_content','field_640e8b307a958'),(133554,2252,'problem_icons_0_prob_icon','1699'),(133555,2252,'_problem_icons_0_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(133556,2252,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','70% highly concerned'),(133557,2252,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(133558,2252,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(133559,2252,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(133560,2252,'problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text',''),(133561,2252,'_problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(133562,2252,'problem_icons','4'),(133563,2252,'_problem_icons','field_640fa0191d518'),(133564,2252,'ceh_content_left',''),(133565,2252,'_ceh_content_left','field_640e97e8f1c8c'),(133566,2252,'ceh_content_right',''),(133567,2252,'_ceh_content_right','field_640e97fdf1c8d'),(133568,2252,'pc_content_left',''),(133569,2252,'_pc_content_left','field_640e983bf1c8f'),(133570,2252,'pc_content_right',''),(133571,2252,'_pc_content_right','field_640e984df1c90'),(133572,2252,'problem_icons_1_prob_icon','1699'),(133573,2252,'_problem_icons_1_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(133574,2252,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','69% highly concerned'),(133575,2252,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(133576,2252,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(133577,2252,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(133578,2252,'proble