 will be located in Central NSW about 5km south-west of the small rural township of Coolah. About 120 wind turbines are being proposed across two clusters at Mount Hope and Black Stump.'),(134625,2264,'_sec_4_text','field_5de7084812a82'),(134626,2264,'sec_4_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/about/\">Detailed location information</a>'),(134627,2264,'_sec_4_button','field_5de7085e12a83'),(134628,2264,'news_title','Project updates'),(134629,2264,'_news_title','field_5de78da3aabb9'),(134630,2264,'sec_2_text_copy',''),(134631,2264,'_sec_2_text_copy','field_5de78dc89e613'),(134632,2264,'timeline-title','Timeline'),(134633,2264,'_timeline-title','field_5de78df29e615'),(134634,2264,'timeline_title','Timeline'),(134635,2264,'_timeline_title','field_5de78df29e615'),(134636,2264,'contact_title','Contact us'),(134637,2264,'_contact_title','field_5de7981e06057'),(134638,2264,'contact_intro','Contact text...'),(134639,2264,'_contact_intro','field_5de7983506058'),(134640,2264,'news_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home btn-news\" href=\"/updates/\">See all updates</a>'),(134641,2264,'_news_button','field_5de8329896e02'),(134642,2264,'timeline_intro','Introduction of timeline detail...'),(134643,2264,'_timeline_intro','field_5de98f5fb1781'),(134644,2264,'timeline_pic','477'),(134645,2264,'_timeline_pic','field_5de98f72b1782'),(134646,2264,'timeline_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home btn-news\" href=\"/about/\">Detailed timeline</a>'),(134647,2264,'_timeline_button','field_5de99363677f8'),(134648,2264,'banner_image_position','center'),(134649,2264,'_banner_image_position','field_5f3bc4757dd02'),(134650,2264,'services_title','Our services'),(134651,2264,'_services_title','field_5f20f3cd80eb2'),(134652,2264,'services_items_0_services_item_image','1061'),(134653,2264,'_services_items_0_services_item_image','field_5f2121355be14'),(134654,2264,'services_items_0_sservices_item_title','1300 Telephone counselling line'),(134655,2264,'_services_items_0_sservices_item_title','fiel