 	<li>Rebalance tenancy laws to provide renters with more security and control, such as eliminating no grounds evictions.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out stamp duty and replace it with a broad-based land tax.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>While there are many opinions on what policy changes will fix the housing market, doing nothing is not an option.</h4>'),(135039,2264,'_solutions_content','field_640e8b307a958'),(135040,2264,'problem_icons_0_prob_icon','1699'),(135041,2264,'_problem_icons_0_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(135042,2264,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','70% highly concerned'),(135043,2264,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(135044,2264,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(135045,2264,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(135046,2264,'problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text',''),(135047,2264,'_problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(135048,2264,'problem_icons','4'),(135049,2264,'_problem_icons','field_640fa0191d518'),(135050,2264,'ceh_content_left',''),(135051,2264,'_ceh_content_left','field_640e97e8f1c8c'),(135052,2264,'ceh_content_right',''),(135053,2264,'_ceh_content_right','field_640e97fdf1c8d'),(135054,2264,'pc_content_left',''),(135055,2264,'_pc_content_left','field_640e983bf1c8f'),(135056,2264,'pc_content_right',''),(135057,2264,'_pc_content_right','field_640e984df1c90'),(135058,2264,'problem_icons_1_prob_icon','1699'),(135059,2264,'_problem_icons_1_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(135060,2264,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','69% highly concerned'),(135061,2264,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(135062,2264,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(135063,2264,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(135064,2264,'problem_icons_1_prob_issue_text',''),(135065,2264,'_problem_icons_1_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(135066,2264,'problem_icons_2_prob_icon','1699'),(135067,2264,'_problem_i