ich limit rental increases beyond what is fair.</li>\r\n 	<li>Rebalance tenancy laws to provide renters with more security and control, such as eliminating no grounds evictions.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out stamp duty and replace it with a broad-based land tax.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>While there are many opinions on what policy changes will fix the housing market, doing nothing is not an option.</h4>'),(135763,2265,'_solutions_content','field_640e8b307a958'),(135764,2265,'problem_icons_0_prob_icon','1699'),(135765,2265,'_problem_icons_0_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(135766,2265,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','70% highly concerned'),(135767,2265,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(135768,2265,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(135769,2265,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(135770,2265,'problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text',''),(135771,2265,'_problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(135772,2265,'problem_icons','4'),(135773,2265,'_problem_icons','field_640fa0191d518'),(135774,2265,'ceh_content_left',''),(135775,2265,'_ceh_content_left','field_640e97e8f1c8c'),(135776,2265,'ceh_content_right',''),(135777,2265,'_ceh_content_right','field_640e97fdf1c8d'),(135778,2265,'pc_content_left',''),(135779,2265,'_pc_content_left','field_640e983bf1c8f'),(135780,2265,'pc_content_right',''),(135781,2265,'_pc_content_right','field_640e984df1c90'),(135782,2265,'problem_icons_1_prob_icon','1699'),(135783,2265,'_problem_icons_1_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(135784,2265,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','69% highly concerned'),(135785,2265,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(135786,2265,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(135787,2265,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(135788,2265,'problem_icons_1_prob_issue_text',''),(135789,2265,'_problem_icons_1_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(135790,2265,'pro