 housing.</li>\r\n 	<li>Establish laws which limit rental increases beyond what is fair.</li>\r\n 	<li>Rebalance tenancy laws to provide renters with more security and control, such as eliminating no grounds evictions.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out stamp duty and replace it with a broad-based land tax.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>While there are many opinions on what policy changes will fix the housing market, doing nothing is not an option.</h4>'),(136484,2266,'_solutions_content','field_640e8b307a958'),(136485,2266,'problem_icons_0_prob_icon','1699'),(136486,2266,'_problem_icons_0_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(136487,2266,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','70% highly concerned'),(136488,2266,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(136489,2266,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(136490,2266,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(136491,2266,'problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text',''),(136492,2266,'_problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(136493,2266,'problem_icons','4'),(136494,2266,'_problem_icons','field_640fa0191d518'),(136495,2266,'ceh_content_left',''),(136496,2266,'_ceh_content_left','field_640e97e8f1c8c'),(136497,2266,'ceh_content_right',''),(136498,2266,'_ceh_content_right','field_640e97fdf1c8d'),(136499,2266,'pc_content_left',''),(136500,2266,'_pc_content_left','field_640e983bf1c8f'),(136501,2266,'pc_content_right',''),(136502,2266,'_pc_content_right','field_640e984df1c90'),(136503,2266,'problem_icons_1_prob_icon','1699'),(136504,2266,'_problem_icons_1_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(136505,2266,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','69% highly concerned'),(136506,2266,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(136507,2266,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(136508,2266,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(136509,2266,'problem_icons_1_prob_issue_text',''),(136510,2266,'_problem_icons_1_prob_issue_text'