greement between commonwealth and state governments with targets and funding for the construction of affordable homes.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out tax breaks for property investors and using the increase in revenue to build more public housing.</li>\r\n 	<li>Establish laws which limit rental increases beyond what is fair.</li>\r\n 	<li>Rebalance tenancy laws to provide renters with more security and control, such as eliminating no grounds evictions.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out stamp duty and replace it with a broad-based land tax.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>While there are many opinions on what policy changes will fix the housing market, doing nothing is not an option.</h4>'),(153501,2457,'_solutions_content','field_640e8b307a958'),(153502,2457,'problem_icons_0_prob_icon','1699'),(153503,2457,'_problem_icons_0_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(153504,2457,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','70% highly concerned'),(153505,2457,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(153506,2457,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(153507,2457,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(153508,2457,'problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text',''),(153509,2457,'_problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(153510,2457,'problem_icons','4'),(153511,2457,'_problem_icons','field_640fa0191d518'),(153512,2457,'ceh_content_left',''),(153513,2457,'_ceh_content_left','field_640e97e8f1c8c'),(153514,2457,'ceh_content_right',''),(153515,2457,'_ceh_content_right','field_640e97fdf1c8d'),(153516,2457,'pc_content_left',''),(153517,2457,'_pc_content_left','field_640e983bf1c8f'),(153518,2457,'pc_content_right',''),(153519,2457,'_pc_content_right','field_640e984df1c90'),(153520,2457,'problem_icons_1_prob_icon','1699'),(153521,2457,'_problem_icons_1_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(153522,2457,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','69% highly concerned'),(153523,2457,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(153524,2457,'pro