on things that matter to us.\r\n\r\nThe Dialogue is a hub of knowledge and collaboration, separate from government, where we work together to come up. With new ideas on important topics. Our ideas can make a big difference in how services and systems are set up for people with disabilities.'),(153721,2457,'_intro_text','field_66441acfe963c'),(153722,2457,'word_link','#'),(153723,2457,'_word_link','field_6646c69723804'),(153724,2457,'pdf_link','#'),(153725,2457,'_pdf_link','field_6646c6da23805'),(153726,2457,'intro_boxes_0_box_image','2241'),(153727,2457,'_intro_boxes_0_box_image','field_65262db5d36ee'),(153728,2457,'intro_boxes_1_box_image','2179'),(153729,2457,'_intro_boxes_1_box_image','field_65262db5d36ee'),(153730,2457,'intro_boxes_2_box_image','2012'),(153731,2457,'_intro_boxes_2_box_image','field_65262db5d36ee'),(153732,2457,'intro_boxes_0_box_excerpt','Excerpt text here just a sentance or so and no more.'),(153733,2457,'_intro_boxes_0_box_excerpt','field_665975273e827'),(153734,2457,'intro_boxes_1_box_excerpt','Excerpt text here just a sentance or so and no more.'),(153735,2457,'_intro_boxes_1_box_excerpt','field_665975273e827'),(153736,2457,'intro_boxes_2_box_excerpt','Excerpt text here just a sentance or so and no more.'),(153737,2457,'_intro_boxes_2_box_excerpt','field_665975273e827'),(153738,2457,'intro_boxes_0_btn-text','Latest events'),(153739,2457,'_intro_boxes_0_btn-text','field_665abda8b8d4b'),(153740,2457,'intro_boxes_1_btn-text','Latest projects'),(153741,2457,'_intro_boxes_1_btn-text','field_665abda8b8d4b'),(153742,2457,'intro_boxes_2_btn-text','Latest ideas'),(153743,2457,'_intro_boxes_2_btn-text','field_665abda8b8d4b'),(153744,2457,'display-easy-read',''),(153745,2457,'_display-easy-read','field_666129bd2da00'),(153746,2457,'hm_hero_sum','Statement about the issue and lost life savings'),(153747,2457,'_hm_hero_sum','field_64ed37241effa'),(153750,2458,'footnotes',''),(153752,2263,'hm_hero_sub','Short sub para about the issue'),(153753,2263,'_hm_h