lish laws which limit rental increases beyond what is fair.</li>\r\n 	<li>Rebalance tenancy laws to provide renters with more security and control, such as eliminating no grounds evictions.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out stamp duty and replace it with a broad-based land tax.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>While there are many opinions on what policy changes will fix the housing market, doing nothing is not an option.</h4>'),(155709,2466,'_solutions_content','field_640e8b307a958'),(155710,2466,'problem_icons_0_prob_icon','1699'),(155711,2466,'_problem_icons_0_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(155712,2466,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','70% highly concerned'),(155713,2466,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(155714,2466,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(155715,2466,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(155716,2466,'problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text',''),(155717,2466,'_problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(155718,2466,'problem_icons','4'),(155719,2466,'_problem_icons','field_640fa0191d518'),(155720,2466,'ceh_content_left',''),(155721,2466,'_ceh_content_left','field_640e97e8f1c8c'),(155722,2466,'ceh_content_right',''),(155723,2466,'_ceh_content_right','field_640e97fdf1c8d'),(155724,2466,'pc_content_left',''),(155725,2466,'_pc_content_left','field_640e983bf1c8f'),(155726,2466,'pc_content_right',''),(155727,2466,'_pc_content_right','field_640e984df1c90'),(155728,2466,'problem_icons_1_prob_icon','1699'),(155729,2466,'_problem_icons_1_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(155730,2466,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','69% highly concerned'),(155731,2466,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(155732,2466,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(155733,2466,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(155734,2466,'problem_icons_1_prob_issue_text',''),(155735,2466,'_problem_icons_1_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(1557