p for people with disabilities.'),(155929,2466,'_intro_text','field_66441acfe963c'),(155930,2466,'word_link','#'),(155931,2466,'_word_link','field_6646c69723804'),(155932,2466,'pdf_link','#'),(155933,2466,'_pdf_link','field_6646c6da23805'),(155934,2466,'intro_boxes_0_box_image','2241'),(155935,2466,'_intro_boxes_0_box_image','field_65262db5d36ee'),(155936,2466,'intro_boxes_1_box_image','2179'),(155937,2466,'_intro_boxes_1_box_image','field_65262db5d36ee'),(155938,2466,'intro_boxes_2_box_image','2012'),(155939,2466,'_intro_boxes_2_box_image','field_65262db5d36ee'),(155940,2466,'intro_boxes_0_box_excerpt','Excerpt text here just a sentance or so and no more.'),(155941,2466,'_intro_boxes_0_box_excerpt','field_665975273e827'),(155942,2466,'intro_boxes_1_box_excerpt','Excerpt text here just a sentance or so and no more.'),(155943,2466,'_intro_boxes_1_box_excerpt','field_665975273e827'),(155944,2466,'intro_boxes_2_box_excerpt','Excerpt text here just a sentance or so and no more.'),(155945,2466,'_intro_boxes_2_box_excerpt','field_665975273e827'),(155946,2466,'intro_boxes_0_btn-text','Latest events'),(155947,2466,'_intro_boxes_0_btn-text','field_665abda8b8d4b'),(155948,2466,'intro_boxes_1_btn-text','Latest projects'),(155949,2466,'_intro_boxes_1_btn-text','field_665abda8b8d4b'),(155950,2466,'intro_boxes_2_btn-text','Latest ideas'),(155951,2466,'_intro_boxes_2_btn-text','field_665abda8b8d4b'),(155952,2466,'display-easy-read',''),(155953,2466,'_display-easy-read','field_666129bd2da00'),(155954,2466,'hm_hero_sum','Statement about the issue and lost life savings'),(155955,2466,'_hm_hero_sum','field_64ed37241effa'),(155956,2466,'hm_hero_sub','Short sub para about the issue'),(155957,2466,'_hm_hero_sub','field_64ed37241effa'),(155958,2466,'intro_head','We’re here to help.'),(155959,2466,'_intro_head','field_64e828783ad9f'),(155960,2466,'intro_content','Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, cons ectetuer adipiscing elit, sed diam nonummy nibh euismod tincidunt ut laoreet dolore magna aliqu