n ambitious national housing agreement between commonwealth and state governments with targets and funding for the construction of affordable homes.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out tax breaks for property investors and using the increase in revenue to build more public housing.</li>\r\n 	<li>Establish laws which limit rental increases beyond what is fair.</li>\r\n 	<li>Rebalance tenancy laws to provide renters with more security and control, such as eliminating no grounds evictions.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out stamp duty and replace it with a broad-based land tax.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>While there are many opinions on what policy changes will fix the housing market, doing nothing is not an option.</h4>'),(156455,2469,'_solutions_content','field_640e8b307a958'),(156456,2469,'problem_icons_0_prob_icon','1699'),(156457,2469,'_problem_icons_0_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(156458,2469,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','70% highly concerned'),(156459,2469,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(156460,2469,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(156461,2469,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(156462,2469,'problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text',''),(156463,2469,'_problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(156464,2469,'problem_icons','4'),(156465,2469,'_problem_icons','field_640fa0191d518'),(156466,2469,'ceh_content_left',''),(156467,2469,'_ceh_content_left','field_640e97e8f1c8c'),(156468,2469,'ceh_content_right',''),(156469,2469,'_ceh_content_right','field_640e97fdf1c8d'),(156470,2469,'pc_content_left',''),(156471,2469,'_pc_content_left','field_640e983bf1c8f'),(156472,2469,'pc_content_right',''),(156473,2469,'_pc_content_right','field_640e984df1c90'),(156474,2469,'problem_icons_1_prob_icon','1699'),(156475,2469,'_problem_icons_1_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(156476,2469,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','69% highly concerned'),(156477,2469,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','field_640