mmunity come together to work on things that matter to us.\r\n\r\nThe Dialogue is a hub of knowledge and collaboration, separate from government, where we work together to come up. With new ideas on important topics. Our ideas can make a big difference in how services and systems are set up for people with disabilities.'),(156675,2469,'_intro_text','field_66441acfe963c'),(156676,2469,'word_link','#'),(156677,2469,'_word_link','field_6646c69723804'),(156678,2469,'pdf_link','#'),(156679,2469,'_pdf_link','field_6646c6da23805'),(156680,2469,'intro_boxes_0_box_image','2241'),(156681,2469,'_intro_boxes_0_box_image','field_65262db5d36ee'),(156682,2469,'intro_boxes_1_box_image','2179'),(156683,2469,'_intro_boxes_1_box_image','field_65262db5d36ee'),(156684,2469,'intro_boxes_2_box_image','2012'),(156685,2469,'_intro_boxes_2_box_image','field_65262db5d36ee'),(156686,2469,'intro_boxes_0_box_excerpt','Excerpt text here just a sentance or so and no more.'),(156687,2469,'_intro_boxes_0_box_excerpt','field_665975273e827'),(156688,2469,'intro_boxes_1_box_excerpt','Excerpt text here just a sentance or so and no more.'),(156689,2469,'_intro_boxes_1_box_excerpt','field_665975273e827'),(156690,2469,'intro_boxes_2_box_excerpt','Excerpt text here just a sentance or so and no more.'),(156691,2469,'_intro_boxes_2_box_excerpt','field_665975273e827'),(156692,2469,'intro_boxes_0_btn-text','Latest events'),(156693,2469,'_intro_boxes_0_btn-text','field_665abda8b8d4b'),(156694,2469,'intro_boxes_1_btn-text','Latest projects'),(156695,2469,'_intro_boxes_1_btn-text','field_665abda8b8d4b'),(156696,2469,'intro_boxes_2_btn-text','Latest ideas'),(156697,2469,'_intro_boxes_2_btn-text','field_665abda8b8d4b'),(156698,2469,'display-easy-read',''),(156699,2469,'_display-easy-read','field_666129bd2da00'),(156700,2469,'hm_hero_sum','Statement about the issue and lost life savings'),(156701,2469,'_hm_hero_sum','field_64ed37241effa'),(156702,2469,'hm_hero_sub','Short sub para about the issue'),(156703,2469,'_hm_