1','2019-12-15 09:57:51','',0,'http://localhost/?p=61',0,'post','',0),(65,1,'2017-05-08 02:00:04','2017-05-08 02:00:04','Content...','Event item three longer link title over two lines','Event item three excerpt about two sentences to show decent length','publish','open','open','','event-item-three-longer-link-title-over-two-lines','','','2019-12-15 04:24:34','2019-12-15 04:24:34','',0,'http://localhost/?p=65',0,'post','',0),(85,1,'2018-07-25 09:05:28','2018-07-25 09:05:28',' ','','','publish','closed','closed','','85','','','2018-07-25 09:05:28','2018-07-25 09:05:28','',0,'http://localhost/2018/07/25/',1,'nav_menu_item','',0),(86,1,'2015-07-07 05:32:38','2015-07-07 05:32:38','Welcome to WordPress. This is your first post. Edit or delete it, then start blogging!','Holding post research or publication','','publish','open','open','','holding-post','','','2015-07-07 05:32:38','2015-07-07 05:32:38','',0,'http://localhost/?p=1',0,'post','',1),(135,1,'2017-05-17 11:49:11','2017-05-17 11:49:11','The Occupational Therapy Department at Australian Catholic University (ACU) North Sydney Campus are looking for individuals with a neurological condition to participate in teaching sessions with our 3rd Year students.  This experience is part of a subject they are completing this semester, called \"<em>Interventions for Neurological Conditions</em>\".  The sessions will run in two 1-hour blocks on <strong>Thursday 10<sup>th</sup> September 2015 (Time to be confirmed) </strong>and will be held at the North Sydney campus of ACU.\n\nParticipants will be asked to engage with small groups of students in a practice interview, where students will have a chance to ask you carefully prepared questions about your everyday life  and the changes you have experienced in your life since your stroke.  The information students collect will be used as a basis for an assignment to develop a therapy plan from an initial interview.  Your name will not be used in the assignment to maintain confidentiality. It would be good to hear whether anyone would be willing to lend their time for this activity.\n\nTaxi vouchers for transport will be provided or we can assist with organising parking on campus. We are aware of the positive and influential impact past patients can have on students and feel this experience will be invaluable for them as they prepare to be qualified occupational therapists. I would be happy to provide any other information needed and can be contacted at <a href=\"mailto:Ruth.Swanton@acu.edu.au\">Ruth.Swanton@acu.edu.au</a>','Australian Catholic University North Sydney Campus','','publish','closed','closed','','australian-catholic-university-north-sydney-campus','','','2017-05-17 11:49:11','2017-05-17 11:49:11','',0,'http://localhost/?post_type=stroke_research&amp;p=135',0,'stroke_research','',0),(136,1,'2017-05-17 11:50:54','2017-05-17 11:50:54','Content','Publications test','','publish','closed','closed','','publications-test','','','2017-05-17 11:50:54','2017-05-17 11:50:54','',0,'http://localhost/?post_type=stroke_publications&amp;p=136',0,'stroke_publications','',0),(164,1,'2017-09-18 23:53:15','2017-09-18 23:53:15','lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. Ut enim ad minim veniam, quis nostrud exercitation ullamco laboris nisi ut aliquip ex ea commodo consequat.','Quote 1','','publish','closed','closed','','quote-1','','','2017-09-18 23:53:15','2017-09-18 23:53:15','',0,'http://localhost/?post_type=slide&amp;p=164',0,'slide','',0),(165,1,'2017-09-18 23:54:51','2017-09-18 23:54:51','Ut enim ad minim veniam, quis nostrud exercitation ullamco laboris nisi ut aliquip ex ea commodo consequat. Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua.','Quote 2','','publish','closed','closed','','quote-2','','','2017-09-18 23:54:51','2017-09-18 23:54:51','',0,'http://localhost/?post_type=slide&amp;p=165