ttps://protectqueensland.org.au/campaigns/more-national-parks/\" title=\"Our National Parks\">Find out more</a></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:media-text -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"55px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:55px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" id=\"forests\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:media-text {\"mediaPosition\":\"right\",\"mediaId\":373,\"mediaLink\":\"https://protectqueensland.org.au/picture1/\",\"mediaType\":\"image\",\"imageFill\":true,\"focalPoint\":{\"x\":0.56,\"y\":0.34}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text has-media-on-the-right is-stacked-on-mobile is-image-fill\"><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Protecting Native Forests</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Native State Forests in Queensland are more than just trees - they represent a vast and irreplaceable ecological treasure. These forests provide a critical habitat for threatened and endangered species and act as significant carbon stores, making their protection crucial for Queensland and Australia\'s environmental credibility.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Transitioning these State Forests to conservation reserves would not only benefit nature but also regional communities. National and conservation parks generate billions in annual revenue from tourism, providing employment and recreational opportunities for locals and visitors in hospitality and nature-based tourism.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"btn btn-block\"} -->\n<p class=\"btn btn-block\"><strong><a href=\"https://protectqueensland.org.au/campaigns/protect-native-forests/\" title=\"Protect Native Forests\">Find out more</a></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\" style=\"background-image:url(https://protectqueensland.org.au/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/Picture1-683x1024.jpg);background-position:56% 34%\"><img src=\"https://protectqueensland.org.au/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/Picture1-683x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-373 size-full\"/></figure></div>\n<!-- /wp:media-text -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"55px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:55px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" id=\"refuges\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:media-text {\"mediaId\":270,\"mediaLink\":\"https://protectqueensland.org.au/how/dcim103goprog0055512-jpg/\",\"mediaType\":\"image\",\"imageFill\":true,\"focalPoint\":{\"x\":0.55,\"y\":0.52}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text is-stacked-on-mobile is-image-fill\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\" style=\"background-image:url(https://protectqueensland.org.au/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/RS4361_G0055512-lpr-background-1024x456.jpg);background-position:55% 52%\"><img src=\"https://protectqueensland.org.au/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/RS4361_G0055512-lpr-background-1024x456.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-270 size-full\"/></figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">More private protected areas</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Private protected areas are also an important part of the solution. Queensland is home to the nation’s largest private protected area program, called the Nature Refuges program.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This program allows landholders to access funding to undertake conservation work on their properties, while placing permanent protections on parts of their land.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Unfortunately, this vital program is now dangerously underfunded</strong>, meaning landholders wishing to access it are not being given the chance.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"btn btn-block\"} -->\n<p class=\"btn btn-block\"><strong><a href=\"/campaigns/nature-refuges/\" title=\"\">Find out more</a></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:media-text -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->','How','','inherit','closed','closed','','1878-revision-v1','','','2023-09-21 08:22:36','2023-09-21 08:22:36','',1878,'http://localhost/?p=1882',0,'revision','',0),(1884,1,'2025-12-09 04:53:38','2023-10-10 01:32:47',' ','','','publish','closed','closed','','1884','','','2025-12-09 04:53:38','2025-12-09 04:53:38','',0,'http://localhost/?p=1884',9,'nav_menu_item','',0),(1891,1,'2023-10-10 05:26:15','2023-10-10 05:26:15','','sc_logo','','inherit','open','closed','','sc_logo','','','2023-10-10 05:26:15','2023-10-10 05:26:15','',0,'http://localhost/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/sc_logo.svg',0,'attachment','image/svg+xml',0),(1892,1,'2023-10-10 05:27:39','2023-10-10 05:27:39','','sc_logo_rev','','inherit','open','closed','','sc_logo_rev','','','2023-10-10 05:27:39','2023-10-10 05:27:39','',0,'http://localhost/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/sc_logo_rev.svg',0,'attachment','image/svg+xml',0),(1893,1,'2023-10-10 05:44:13','2023-10-10 05:44:13','<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Everybody’s home is different, but we all want the same thing: a place to build a fulfilling life.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Australia is a rich country, but despite our growing national wealth, for many people the Australian dream seems increasingly out of reach.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Renters are seeing huge price increases and insecure tenancy agreements.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>First home buyers are struggling to scrape together a deposit.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Low-income families are facing years on the waiting list for social housing.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp: