ning/buying-guides/financial-planning\">How to find a good financial adviser</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://moneysmart.gov.au/financial-advice/financial-advisers-register\">ASIC’s Financial Adviser Register - individuals</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://service.asic.gov.au/search/\">ASIC’s Professional Registers Search - companies</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:kadence/table-data -->\n<!-- /wp:kadence/table-row -->\n\n<!-- wp:kadence/table-row {\"uniqueID\":\"2494_718136-71\",\"row\":4} -->\n<!-- wp:kadence/table-data {\"uniqueID\":\"2494_7d5913-91\",\"column\":0} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Reporting misconduct to ASIC</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:kadence/table-data -->\n\n<!-- wp:kadence/table-data {\"uniqueID\":\"2494_d6d5e8-c9\",\"column\":1} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://www.asic.gov.au/about-asic/contact-us/reporting-misconduct-to-asic/make-a-report-of-misconduct-to-asic\">Make a report of misconduct to ASIC</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:kadence/table-data -->\n<!-- /wp:kadence/table-row -->\n<!-- /wp:kadence/table -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Make a Complaint','','publish','closed','closed','','make-a-complaint','','','2025-12-09 05:01:57','2025-12-09 05:01:57','',0,'http://localhost/?page_id=2494',0,'page','',0),(2495,1,'2025-12-09 02:58:35','2025-12-09 02:58:35','<!-- wp:acf/anchor-nav {\"name\":\"acf/anchor-nav\",\"data\":{\"anchor_links_0_label\":\"Step 1 | Make a complaint to the financial business\",\"_anchor_links_0_label\":\"field_69376909bd16f\",\"anchor_links_0_anchor_id\":\"Step1\",\"_anchor_links_0_anchor_id\":\"field_69376918bd170\",\"anchor_links_1_label\":\"Step 2 | Step two title\",\"_anchor_links_1_label\":\"field_69376909bd16f\",\"anchor_links_1_anchor_id\":\"Step2\",\"_anchor_links_1_anchor_id\":\"field_69376918bd170\",\"anchor_links\":2,\"_anchor_links\":\"fie