02:58:38','2025-12-09 02:58:38','',0,'http://localhost/wpa-stats/make-a-complaint/',0,'wpa-stats','',0),(2498,1,'2025-12-09 03:33:23','2025-12-09 03:33:23','<!-- wp:acf/anchor-nav {\"name\":\"acf/anchor-nav\",\"data\":{\"anchor_links_0_label\":\"The AFCA complaint process\",\"_anchor_links_0_label\":\"field_69376909bd16f\",\"anchor_links_0_anchor_id\":\"AFCA_Complaint\",\"_anchor_links_0_anchor_id\":\"field_69376918bd170\",\"anchor_links_1_label\":\"Step 1 | Make a complaint to the financial business\",\"_anchor_links_1_label\":\"field_69376909bd16f\",\"anchor_links_1_anchor_id\":\"Step1\",\"_anchor_links_1_anchor_id\":\"field_69376918bd170\",\"anchor_links_2_label\":\"Step 2 | Step two title\",\"_anchor_links_2_label\":\"field_69376909bd16f\",\"anchor_links_2_anchor_id\":\"Step2\",\"_anchor_links_2_anchor_id\":\"field_69376918bd170\",\"anchor_links_3_label\":\"\",\"_anchor_links_3_label\":\"field_69376909bd16f\",\"anchor_links_3_anchor_id\":\"\",\"_anchor_links_3_anchor_id\":\"field_69376918bd170\",\"anchor_links\":4,\"_anchor_links\":\"field_693768d3bd16e\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How to make a complaint</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You’ve been impacted by the collapse of Shield or First Guardian Master Fund and you want to get your money back - what do you need to do? This page provides information on how to ask for compensation from different financial businesses that may have been involved in your investment journey.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"AFCA_Complaint\">The AFCA complaint process</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you have lost money as a result of the collapse of Shield or First Guardian, you may be able to get compensation. To get compensation, you must make a complaint. You have a right to complain to the Australian Financial Complaints Authority (AFCA) about a financial business you have concerns with as long as they are an AFCA member. This page explains the process of making an AFCA complaint as well as important information about deadlines.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:details {\"className\":\"step-effects\"} -->\n<details id=\"Step5\" class=\"wp-block-details step-effects\"><summary>Step 1 | Step 1 title</summary><!-- wp:paragraph {\"placeholder\":\"Type / to add a hidden block\"} -->\n<p>Content</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Content</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":2329,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:4000:4000:4000:4000:4000:4000:4000:4000:4000/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/shutterstock_2498750441_neutral-1024x501.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2329\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/steps-section {\"name\":\"acf/steps-section\",\"data\":{\"steps_heading\":\"breakout\",\"_steps_heading\":\"field_69324339e80aa\",\"steps_sub_heading\":\"\",\"_steps_sub_heading\":\"field_6932434ae80ab\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>col</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"backgroundColor\":\"pale-pink\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column has-pale-pink-background-color has-background\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"backgroundColor\":\"vivid-green-cyan\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column has-vivid-green-cyan-background-color has-background\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"backgroundColor\":\"vivid-red\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column has-vivid-red-background-color has-background\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></details>\n<!-- /wp:details -->\n\n<!-- wp:details {\"className\":\"step-effects\"} -->\n<details class=\"wp-block-details step-effects\"><summary>Step 2 |  Step 2 title</summary><!-- wp:paragraph {\"placeholder\":\"Type / to add a 